<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Inojile vyoyandichigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lukasi</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na Lukasi ndo imwe ya vitabu vine viwele mli ilagano lya sambi vilingusima mbuli ya ukomu Yesu Kilistu. Chila chimwe changuchemigwa Injili, ilinguzeleka kota Mbuli Inojile. Navyandichigwa na Matei na Malichi na Lukasi na Yohana, mhela Yesu loyabagame. Lukasi handiche yeka mbuli ya ukomu wa Yesu, ila nakandika vinhu vyeng'ha, walanguswa wa Yesu vyowaditile loyabagame na kuzilipuka, chitabu chino chilinguchemigwa Madito ga watumigwa. Kuduhuli ne yumwe yavizelele mhela wachi na kohi Mbuli Inojile ya Lukasi koyandichigwe, ila wasomile wangukunda kota hanji nayandichigwa kuli mhela wa miyaka makumi saba kulawila Yesu loyavumbuche.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukasi ndo yandiche, heye nayali dakitali. Nzila yoyandiche na ndonga yoyatumiye, yangulajila kota heye nakasoma lukami. Lukasi nakagana kwandika goya mbuli ya ukomu wa Yesu, yosima madito nagalawile, ahyo wanji welanguse kwa kugasoma (Lukasi 1:1-3). Nahawele Myahudi (Wakolosai 4:10-14). Nakandika kota hana wanhu hawawele Wayahudi wavizele choyandiche. Ayi yangoneka hala hoyasimile vihendo vya Wayahudi (Lukasi 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inojile yandichigwe na Lukasi iwhana ng'hatu na vitabu vya Matei na Malichi kwa vila vyangusima mbuli nyinji zilingiwhana na nzila imwe. Mli vitabu vidatu, Lukasi changusima mbuli nyinji zilinguwala kuvumbuka kwa Yohana mbatiza. Lukasi kahi kanguhimiliza mbuli ya kilechela na kigana (Lukasi 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34) na kumlanda Nguluwi (Lukasi 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Kuli sula ya (Lukasi 1:1-4), Lukasi kangulonga mbuli ya Injili ya heye na chiwalo cha kwandika.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Hamba kangusima kuvumbuka kwa Yesu na vyoyawichile goya kwaluka kulangusa (Lukasi 1:5-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Honhu hakulu ha Injili (Lukasi 4:14-21:38), Lukasi kangusima mbuli ya mijito yoyakolile Yesu, kota vila vinduzanduza vyoyaditile na vinhu vyoyalanguse.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kuduma, kuli sula mbili za kuduma za chitabu, Lukasi kangusima vila Yesu vyobagame na kutiligwa na kuzilipuka.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mkulu Teofili, wanhu wenji nawadita kota vila vyowadahile kwandika vinhu vila vilawile hagati ha hetwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Nawandika vinhu vyotulonjelwe na wala waviwene avyo kwa meho ga hewo kulawa kwaluche na kudamla Mbuli Inojile. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ahyo mkulu Teofili, ingana nani nandola goya vinhu avyo vyeng'ha kulawa mwaluko, nambona ndikwandichile goya vila vilawile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Ndangudita hino leka hegwe nagwe uvizele kukomya kweng'ha kuli vinhu vyoulanguswe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupondigwa kwa Yohani kwangudamuligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mhela Helodi loyawele mndewa wa Yudeya, nakwali na mtambika yumwe itagwa lyake Sekaliya, heye nayali mchilundo cha watambika cha Abiya. Mdala wa heye nakachemigwa Elisabeti, nayali wa lukolo lwa mtambika Aluni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Weng'ha weli nawali watanganiche hali meho ga Nguluwi, nawali wochikala kwa kuwinza vyoyolonga na kulajiza Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Nawalihela mwana, kwa vila Elisabeti nayali mhende, weng'ha weli nawali walalile lukami.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Zuwa limwe Sekaliya nayali yokola mijito ja kutambika kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nayali nzamu ya heye ya kulavya nhambiko. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Kota vyoili chihendo cha watambika, simbi naimgwila Sekaliya kwinjila Ng'handa ya Mkulu kufunyiza ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Wanhu wenji nawali wamemile kunze womlanda Nguluwi mhela awo wa kufunyiza ubani.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Hamba mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlawila Sekaliya, nakema kudilo ha honhu ha kulavila nhambiko ha kufunyizila ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sekaliya loyamuwene, nakatinhuka, nakawa na lunhwinhwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ila mhilisi wa kilanga nakamlonjela, “Sekaliya, uleche kudumba! Nguluwi nakahulika kulanda kwa hegwe. Mdala wa hegwe Elisabeti kolela mwana mlume, nagwe kompa itagwa Yohani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Kosangalala na kusechelela ng'hatu, wanhu wenji wotowa luchenze kwa chiwalo cha kupondigwa kwake. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Kwa vila kowa mng'hangala hali Mkulu Nguluwi. Honwa divai ne chinhu chilingwambuza kugala. Komema Muhe Yelile kulawa mmunda mwa mamo wa heye. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Kowahilusa wanhu wenji wa Isilaeli kwa Mkulu, Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Komlongola Mkulu Nguluwi, kowa na mong'ho na ludali lwa mloli wa Nguluwi, Eliya, kowadita wahaza na wana wegane. Kowagalamla wanhu wohambe wamkunde Nguluwi wawe na majesa gatanganiche na kuwadita wanhu wewiche goya kumbochela Mkulu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sekaliya nakamuuza ayo mhilisi wa kilanga, “Ndovizela ndaze kota mbuli ayi yakukomya? Heni nda sekulu na mdala wa heni kalala.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Yula mhilisi wa kilanga nakamlonjela, “Heni Gabulieli, ndilingwima hali Nguluwi. Heye ndo yandajize kuya kulonga na hegwe na kukulonjela mbuli ayi inojile. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Ila kwa vila hambe ukunde mbuli ayi yoilawila kwa mihela jake, kolemwela kulonga mbaka ago gondikulonjele, galawile.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mhela awo, wala wanhu wali wombeta Sekaliya, nawabubuwala vyoyali yokawila kulawa mli Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Vyoyalawile hanze ya Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakalemwela kulonga nawo, ahyo nawavizela nakona kulota kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi kwa vila nayali yolemwela kulonga, ila nayaliyolajila na moko.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Mhela wa heye wa kukola mijito kuli Ng'handa ya Mkulu Nguluwi lo umalile, nakahiluka kaye. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Hamba kuli mazuwa mado, mche wake Elisabeti nakawa na himila, nakekala haluga kwa myezi jihano. Nakalonga, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Mkulu kanditila aga. Sambi nakandajila isungu lya heye. Nakambusila soni iwele kwa heni hali wanhu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupondigwa kwa Yesu kwangudamligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Kuli mwezi wa sita wa himila ya Elisabeti, Nguluwi nakamlajiza mhilisi wa kilanga yalinguchemigwa Gabulieli, yalute kuli muji ulinguchemigwa Nasaleti, kuli isi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Nakoya kwa mhinza yumwe yalinguchemigwa Maliya, yabanichilwe na munhu yumwe itagwa lyake Yusufu wa lukolo lwa mndewa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Mhilisi wa kilanga nakaluta kwa heye, nakamlamsa, “Kulamka! Mkulu Nguluwi kahamwe na hegwe, naye kakutambichiza ng'hatu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maliya loyahuliche luzi awo, nakesinza lukami, nakaluka kijesa mnhumbula ya heye, kulamsa aku kwa ndaze? <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ila yula mhilisi wa kilanga nakamlonjela, “Maliya, uleche kudumba! Nguluwi nakakugalila kunoga kwa heye. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Lole, kowa na himila, hamba koponda mwana mlume na komchema itagwa lyake Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Heye kowa mng'hangala na kochemigwa Mwana wa Nguluwi yawele kuchanya ng'hatu. Mkulu Nguluwi komdita yawe mndewa kota vyoyali sekulu wa heye Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Kowa mndewa wa lukolo lwa Yakubu mazuwa gose na undewa wa heye wowa hela kuduma!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maliya nakamlonjela mhilisi wa kilanga, “Heni, sinating'hana na mlume. Lelo ago gowa ndaze?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Yula mhilisi wa kilanga nakamlonjela, “Muhe Yelile kokudulichila, na mong'ho wa Nguluwi wokugubika. Kwa mbuli ayo, mwana yelile yoleligwa kochemigwa, Yelile mwana wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Ulole, Elisabeti mng'holoze! Wanhu nawamchema mhende, lelo sambi kana himila ya myezi sita, nakulala koyalalile. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kwa Nguluwi kuduhuli mbuli iwele ngulemwelwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maliya nakalonga “Heni nda chitumagwa wa Mkulu, iwe kota vyoulonjile.” Hamba yula mhilisi wa kilanga nakoka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya kangumjendela Elisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Logakolile mazuwa mado, Maliya nakaluka majendo kuluta hima mbaka kuli muji umwe uwele kuli chidunda cha Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ako nakenjila kuli ng'handa ya Sekaliya, nakamlamsa Elisabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elisabeti loyahuliche kulamsa kwa Maliya, chali nachitigasika mmunda mwa heye. Elisabeti nakamemezwa Muhe Yelile, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />naye nakalonga kwa lizi likulu, “Nakutambichizwa kusinda wadala weng'ha na mwana youmponda nakatambichizwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Heni nda whaani, leka mamo wa Mkulu wa heni yanjendele? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Lonyhuliche ulamso wa hegwe, chali chiwele kuli munda wa heni nachitigasika kwa kusangalala. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Nakutambichizwa ng'hatu hegwe kwa kukunda mbuli ya Mkulu, kwa vila yowa ikomya kwa gala Mkulu goyakulonjele!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa maliya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Maliya nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Nhumbula ya heni yangumutogola Mkulu,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />na muhe wa heni wangusangalala kwa Mbuli ya Nguluwi mlohozi wa heni,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Lekachoni nakang'humbuchila, chitumagwa wa heye yaliholile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kulawila sambi na kulutilila, wanhu weng'ha wonyhema yatambichizwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />kwa vinhu vikulu Nguluwi vyoyaditile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Itagwa lya Nguluwi ndo lyelile.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Isungu lya heye lyanguwalutilaga wala walingumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">lyangikalaga lulelo mbaka lulelo.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Nakadita mbuli ng'hulu kwa moko wa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Nakawasambalula walingidaya kuli nhumbula za hewo.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Nakawadulisa wandewa kulawa kuli vigoda vya hewo vya undewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">nakawakwiniza wala waliholile.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Wawele na nzala nakawagutiza vinhu vinojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">wawele na lufufu nakawaleka walute moko yeng'ha.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Nakamtanza Isilaeli chitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">kwa kukumbuchila isungu lyake.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Kota vyowalongane na wakulu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">Abulahamu na ulelo wa heye mazuwa gose.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliya nakekala na Elisabeti myezi jidatu, hamba nakahiluka kaye kwa heye.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupondigwa kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Mhela wa Elisabeti kuponda naufika, nakaponda mwana mlume. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Walingikalasa habehi nawahulika vila Mkulu Nguluwi kamonela isungu ng'hatu, nawasangalala hamwe na heye.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Hamba mazuwa nane nagafika ga kumwinjiza yula mwana ikumbi, nawali wogana kumchema itagwa lya mhaza wa heye, Sekaliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ila mayake nakalonga, “Hebu! Kochemigwa Yohani.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Nawamlonjela, “Lekachoni haduhu munhu kuli lukolo lwa hemwe, yalinguchemigwa itagwa ali?” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Lelo nawamditila ulajilo mhaza wa mwana leka yamhe itagwa lyachi mwana wa heye. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Heye kalanda chibao cha kwandika kandika hino, Yohani ndo itagwa lyake, weng'ha nawekala wabubuwale. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Bahala umyango na mlomo wa Sekaliya naugubuka nakaluka kulonga kahi yomtogola Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Walingikalasa habehi nawafichigwa na lunhwinhwi, mbuli azo nazenela chila honhu kuli chidunda cha Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Weng'ha wahuliche mbuli ayo, nawejesa mnhumbula zawo wolonga, “Mwana ayu kowa ndaze?” Kwa vila naloneka ludali lwa Mkulu Nguluwi nalwali hamwe na heye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa Sekaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sekaliya, mhaza wa Yohani, nakamemezwa Muhe Yelile, naye nakalavya uloli yolonga.<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />Yatogolwe Mkulu Nguluwi wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">kwa vila nakoya kwa wanhu wa heye na kuwagombola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Nakatugalila mlohozi mkulu yawele na ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">lukolo lwa Daudi chitumagwa wa heye.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Nakatulonjela aho katali kukolela kwa waloli wa heye welile,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kota kotulohola mmoko mwa walingutuzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kulawa mmoko mwa wanhu weng'ha wehile.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Nakalonga kowonela isungu wakulu wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na kukumbuchila ilagano lyelile.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Nakamlahila Abulahamu sekulu wa hetwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Kutulohola mmoko mwa wa wang'honyo wa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">leka tumfugamile heye ne kudumba,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Tuwe welile na watanganiche hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">mazuwa geng'ha ga ukomu wa hetwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nagwe mwana wa heni, kochemigwa mloli wa Mkulu Nguluwi yawele kuchanya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">komlongola Mkulu Nguluwi, komgongomanyila nzila,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />kowawikulila wanhu kota woloholigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">na kusilwa gehile gowaditile.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Nguluwi wa hetwe kana isungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Kotugalila lumuli kulawa kuchanya.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Na kutulangazila weng'ha tulingikala kutitu kuli kwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">na yalongoze magulu ga hetwe kuli nzila za kikala goya.<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana nakakula, nakapata ludali kuli Muhe. Nekekala kugunuche mbaka loyelajile kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kupondigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matei 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Zuwa lila mndewa wa Loma Agusto nakalajiza kota wanhu weng'ha wa isi ila wawazigwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kuwazigwa ako nakwali kwa mwaluko, mhela Kulenio loyawele chilongozi wa mkowa wa Siliya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Weng'ha nawaluta kuwazigwa, chila munhu kaye koyapondigwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yusufu nakalawa muji wa Nasaleti kuli isi ya Galilaya nakaluta muji wa Betelehemu ya mkowa wa Yudeya koyaleligwe mndewa Daudi. Yusufu nakaluta ako kwa vila nayali wa lukolo lwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Nakaluta kuza wazigwa hamwe na mchewake Maliya heye Maliya nayali na himila. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Lowawele ako zuwa lya Maliya kuponda nalifika, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />nakaponda mwana wa mwaluko mlume, nakamvika vibende vya chiwana na kumuwasiliza kuli honhu ha kudila misenga. Kwa vila nawahusa honhu ha kuwasa kuli ng'handa za wajenzi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wadimi na Wahilisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Honhu aho nakwali na wadimi wawele wochikala kuli migunda wokwamila vilundo vya migongolo.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">Mdimi kangulolela migongolo jake</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Mhilisi wa Mkulu Nguluwi nakawalawila na ukulu wa Mkulu Nguluwi nauwalangazila kuli banzi zeng'ha, nawadumba ng'hatu. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Mhilisi wa kilanga nakawalonjela, “Mleche kudumba ikugalilani Mbuli Inojile iwoyele wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Kwa vila, lehano kuli honhu ha Daudi, kaleligwa mlohozi kwa mbuli ya hemwe yuye Kilistu mkulu mlohozi yahaguligwe na Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Achi chokulajilani hemwe mochifika chali chivalizigwe nguwo za chiwana yawasilizwe hali honhu ha kudila misenga. <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Baho chilundo chikulu cha wahilisi wa kilanga nachilongozwa na ayo mhilisi, wazangumtogola Nguluwi wolonga.”<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Tumtogole Nguluwi wa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">kikala goya muisi kuli wanhu yawaganile!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Bahala mhilisi wa kilanga nakoka na kuhiluka kilanga, walingudima wazangilonjela. “Tucheni mbaka Betelehemu tukalilole ali lilawile lyotulonjelwe na Mkulu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Waluta wobilima, wamfika Maliya na Yusufu na yula mwana yawasilizwe honhu ha kulisila misenga, <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Awo wadimi lowamuwene ayo mwana wawalonjela wayao mbuli yowahuliche ya ayo mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Weng'ha wahuliche ago wekala mlomo mwazi mbuli zowalonjelwe na awo wadimi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ila Maliya nakagawika na kijesa aga geng'ha mnhumbula ya heye. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Wala wadimi wahiluka kaye kowekalaga kuno womtogola Nguluwi kwa geng'ha gowahuliche na kugona, geng'ha gawa hihila kota vowalonjelwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana kangupegwa itagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Mazuwa nane logafichile ga kumwinjiza ikumbi ayo mwana, nakapegwa itagwa lilila lya Yesu lyonayapeligwe na mhilisi wa kilanga yang'hali hola nyinda.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulavigwa kumwando kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Logafichile mhela wa kuwelizwa kwa Maliya na Yusufu kota voiganigwe na malajizo ga Musa, lelo, Yusufu na Maliya nawamuhola yula mwana nawaluta Yelusalemu leka wamuwiche chiuyeng'ha kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Mli mzilo wa mkulu yandichigwa. “Chila mwana mlume yalongole kuleligwa, yalavigwe kwa Mkulu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Kahi nawaluta wakalavye nhambiko, ng'hunda mbili kota mzilo wa Mkulu Nguluwi vyoulingulonga.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Mihela ajo ako Yelusalemu kwali na munhu yumwe, nayali yanojile na yalingumdumba Nguluwi itagwa lyake Simoni, heye yaliyobeteza ulohozi wa Isilaeli. Muhe Yelile nayali hamwe na heye. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Muhe Yelile nakamtawiza kota hobagama mbaka yamone Kilistu wa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Yolongozwa na Muhe Yelile, Simoni nakenjila kuli luga lwa Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, wahaza wa Yesu wamgala mwana wa hewo wamditile kota vyoilinguganigwa na malajizo ga Musa, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simoni nakambochela ayo mwana mmoko mwa heye kuno yomtogola Nguluwi yolonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Lelo Nguluwi Mkulu kudita choulonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">mkundize chitumagwa wa hegwe yalute kwa kikala goya.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Mina kwa meho gangu ndiwona ulohozi wa hegwe,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />uwichile woneche na wanhu weng'ha,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />alu ndo lumuli louwamwesele wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na ukulu kwa wanhu wa hegwe Isilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Mhaza wa Yesu na mayake newekala mlomo mwazi kwa ulonzi woyaliyolonga Simeoni kuli yula mwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simoni nakamtambichiza, nakamlonjela Maliya mayake, Mwana ayu nakahaguligwa na Nguluwi kuwifya na kigala ulohozi, kowalohola wanhu wenji wa Isilaeli. Heye kowa ulajilo wa chinhu chilemigwa na wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Majesa ga wanhu wenji gozangoneka hazelu usungu uwele ukali kota ipanga woihoma nhumbula ya hegwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Hali na munhu yumwe yatumigwe mdala itagwa lyake Ana mhinza wa Fanueli wa nhanzi ya Asheli. Nekekala na mlume mihela saba kulawa loyaholigwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Nakekala nayali hela mlume mbaka mihela ajo yawele mng'hangala wa miyaka makumi nane na gane mihela ajo jeng'ha nekekala hali Ng'handa ya Nguluwi yokwesela kulya na kulanda nemisi na nechilo, <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Mihela jijo kalawa kumwando kamtogola Nguluwi na kudamla mbuli za ayo mwana kwa wanhu weng'ha awala wali wobeteza ugombozi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Maliya na Yusufu lowaditile geng'ha gowalonjeligwe na mzilo wa Mkulu Nguluwi, wahiluka kaye kwawo Nasaleti wilaya ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana kakula kawa na ludali na luhala lukami, kunoga kwa Nguluwi kwali na heye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mung'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Chila mhela wahaza wa Yesu nawazowela kuluta Yelusalemu wone iwe mnvina ya Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu navyoyali na miyaka kumi na mili weng'ha waluta kuli mnvina vowazowele, <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Mnvina loimalile nawaluka kuhiluka kaye kwawo, ila msongolo Yesu nakapona Yelusalemu ne wahaza wa heye kuvizela. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Nawavizela nayali hamwe na chilundo cha wanhu wawele ngilongoza, nawajenda nemisi yeng'ha, hamba nawaluka kumpala hali wanhu yoyawazowele. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Lowawene hambe wamone nawahiluka Yelusalemu wompala.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Zuwa lya kadatu nawamfika kuli luga lwa Ng'handa ya Nguluwi hamwe na walangusa wa malajizo yowahulichiza na kuwauza mbuli. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Weng'ha wahuliche ulonzi wa heye wekala mlomo mwazi luhala loyali nalo kwa kwidichila gowali womuuza. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Wahaza wake lowamuwene wekala mlomo mwazi. Mayake kamuuza, “Gwa gomwana lekachoni kutuditila ahi? Mhaza wa hegwe na heni twali tukupala kwa isungu.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Heye kawalonjela, “Lekachoni mnzengumala? Hamvizelele nanganigwa ndikale mng'handa ya Mhaza wa heni?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Wahaza wa heye hawavizelele chila choyali yowalonjela.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu kahiluka hamwe mbaka aho Nasaleti, kawahulika. Mayake kawika geng'ha gala mnhumbula. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu kakula kwa lukuli na kwa luhala na kwakumnojeza Nguluwi na kuwanojeza wanhu kahi.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Kudamla kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matei 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Malichi 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Kuli mwaka wa kumi na jihano ja undewa wa Kaizali Tibeliyo na Pontio Pilato nayali yolongoza honhu ha Yudeya na Helodi nayali yolongoza honhu ha Galilaya na mng'holoze Filipo nayali yolongoza honhu ha Itulea hamwe na honhu ha Tlakoniti, hamba Lusania nayali yolongoza honhu ha Abilene <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />nawo Anasi na Kayafa nawali watambika wakulu. Mhela awo lizi lya Nguluwi nalimuyila Yohani mwana wa Sekaliya kuli honhu hagunuche. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yohani nakaluta mweng'ha kuli mbaka ja lwanda lwa Yolodani. Nakazakuwalangusa wanhu, waleche gehile ga hewo na kubatizigwa leka Nguluwi yawosele gehile.<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kota vyoyandichigwe kuli chitabu cha mloli Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Lizi lya munhu lyanguchema hagunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mumgongomanyile Mkulu nzila ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">mgolole nzila za heye za kukola.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Hagwile howa hatiligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">mula mwinuche mowa muselegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">habinuche howa hagoloswe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">nzila zihile zogoloswa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Na weng'ha womona Nguluwi yowalohola wanhu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Lelo Yohani nayali yowalonjela wanhu wenji woyile kubatizigwa na heye, “Hemwe lulelo lwa izoka! Ndo whaani yawalonjele muibilimile ng'halazi ilinguya? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mlajile kwa madito kota namumgalamchila Nguluwi. Mleche kwaluka sambi kota moibilima ng'halazi ya Nguluwi kwa kulonga, mhaza wa hetwe Abulahamu. Ndanguwalonjelani kota, Nguluwi kana ludali lwa kugagalula aga maganga gawe wana wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Iwago liwichigwa goya kuli mizabi ja igodi. Chila igodi lyohambe lilele mafuza ganojile, lyotemigwa na kutajigwa kuli chiluli.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Wala wanhu wamemile nawamuuza, lelo tudite choni? <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Nakawedichila, “Yawele na migwanda mili yamhe yalihela, hihyo yawele na chilyo yadite hiho.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Wakongoza sendi nawo nawoya kubatizigwa, nawamuuza, “Mlangusa tudite ndaze?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Heye nakawalonjela, “Mleche kukokongoza mzidi.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Wamizi nawo nawamuuza, “Hetwe natwe tudite choni? Nakawedichila, mleche kuhola chinhu cha munhu kwa lupichi kahi mleche kumtagusa munhu kwa udesi, migute na chomlingupegwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Weng'ha nawali wobeteza chinhu chimwenga, nawaluka kiuza mnhumbula za hewo kuwala Yohani hanji heye ndo Kilistu Mlohozi yahaguligwe na Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Baho Yohani nakawalonjela weng'ha, “Heni ndanguwabatiza kwa mazi ila kanguya nayali na ludali kusinda heni. Sijeza kudohola ng'weso za makwamba ga heye. Heye kowa yobatiza kwa Muhe Yelile na kwa chiluli. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Heye kana luhelo lwa kuyugulila nyhadikwa, yalunde uhemba kuli ng'hano na mhumba kozisoma kwa chiluli chohambe chizime.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Hamwe na makanyo menji, Yohani nakawahimiliza wanhu yowadamlila Mbuli Inojile. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ila Yohani nakamdeuza mndewa Helodi kwa vila nakamhola Helodiya mche wa mng'holoze na kumdita mche wake, kahi nakadita gehile ganji. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Kahi Helodi nakadita chinhu chinji chihile kwa kumuwika Yohani mchinweng'ho.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubatizigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matei 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Malichi 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Wanhu weng'ha lowabatizigwe, Yesu naye nakabatizigwa. Loyawele yomlanda Nguluwi, ulanga naugubuka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Muhe Yelile nakadulika yawele na lukuli lulingiwhana kota ng'hunda. Lizi naluhulikwa kulawa kilanga, “Hegwe ndo mwanangu ndikuganile, nojezwa na hegwe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matei 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu loyaluche kukola mijito, nayali na miyaka makumi gadatu, wanhu nawali wochijesa kota heye mwana wa Yusufu yawele mwana wa Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli nayali mwana wa Matati na Matati nayali mwana wa Lawi na Lawi nayali mwana wa Meleki na Meleki nayali mwana wa Yanai na Yanai nayali mwana wa Yusufu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusufu nayali mwana wa Matasia na Matasia nayali mwana wa Amosi na Amosi nayali mwana wa Nahumu na Nahumu nayali mwana wa Hesili na Hesili nayali mwana wa Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagai nayali mwana wa Maati na Maati nayali mwana wa Matasia na Matasia nayali mwana wa Shemeni na Shemeni nayali mwana wa Yoseki na Yoseki nayali mwana wa Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yuda nayali mwana wa Yoanani na Yohanini nayali mwana wa Lisa na Lisa nayali mwana wa Selubabeli nayali mwana wa Shatieli na Sheatieli nayali mwana wa Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli nayali mwanage Meliki na Meliki nayali mwana wa Adi na Adi nayali mwana wa Kosamu na Kosamu nayali mwana wa Elimadamu na Elimadamu nayali mwana wa Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eli yula nayali mwana wa Yoshuwa na Yoshuwa nayali mwana wa Elieseli na Elieseli nayali mwana wa Yolimu na Yolimu nayali mwana wa Matati na Matati nayali mwana wa Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi nayali mwana wa Simeoni na Simeoni nayali mwana wa Yudasi na Yudasi nayali mwana wa Yusufu na Yusufu nayali mwana wa Yonamu na Yonamu nayali mwana wa Eliyakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakimu nayali mwana wa Melea na Melea nayali mwana wa Mena na Mena nayali mwana wa matata na Matata nayali mwana wa Natani na Natani nayali mwana wa Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Daudi nayali mwana wa Yese na Yese nayali mwana wa Obedi na Obedi nayali mwana wa Boasi na Boasi nayali mwana wa Salimoni na Salimoni nayali mwana wa Nashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashoni nayali mwana wa Aminadabu na Aminadabu nayali mwana wa Alini na Alini nayali mwana wa Hesiloni na Hesiloni nayali mwana wa Pelesi na Pelesi nayali mwana wa Yudasi, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yudasi nayali mwana wa Yakubu na Yakubu nayali mwana wa Isaka na Isaka nayali mwana wa Abulahamu na Abulahamu nayali mwana wa Tela na Tela nayali mwana wa Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naholi nayali mwana wa Selugi, na Selugi nayali mwana wa Leu na Leu nayali mwana wa Pelagi na Pelegi nayali mwana wa Ebeli na Ebeli nayali mwana wa Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala nayali mwana wa Kainamu na Kainamu nayali mwana wa Afakisadi na Afakisadi nayali mwana wa Shemu na Shemu nayali mwana wa Nuhu na Nuhu nayali mwana wa Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki nayali mwana wa Metusela na Metusela nayali mwana wa Henoki na Henoki nayali mwana wa Yaledi na Yaledi nayali mwana wa Mahalaleli na Mahalaleli nayali mwana wa Kainamu. <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kainamu nayali mwana wa Enoshi na Enoshi nayali mwana wa Seti na Seti nayali mwana wa Adamu na Adamu nayali mwana wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kujezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matei 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Malichi 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu nakalawa mlwanda lwa Yolodani yamemile Muhe Yelile, Muhe ayo nakamlongoza mbaka kugunuche. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Ako nakajezigwa na Limazoga kwa mazuwa makumi gane. Mazuwa ago geng'ha hadile chinhu choneche chila, logamalile mazuwa ago, nakehulika nzala <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Limazoga nalimlonjela, “Wone uwele Mwanage Nguluwi, lilonjele iganga lino ligaluke kuwa ibumunda.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “nayandichigwa, ‘Munhu howa mkomu kwa ibumunda hela.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Hamba Limazoga nalimhola mbaka kuchanya ng'hatu na kamlajila undewa weng'ha uwele kuli isi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Limazoga limlonjela Yesu, “Ndokupa undewa na ludali lwa vinhu vyeng'ha vino, kwa vila vinhu vyeng'ha namhegwa heni, ndoweza kumha yoneche yula yondimgana. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Avi vyeng'ha vyowa vya hegwe, wone ufugamile heni.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Nayandichigwa, ‘Umfugamile Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe na umditile heye yaliyeka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Hamba Limazoga nalimhola Yesu mbaka Yelusalemu nalimkwiniza kuli ilingo lya Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nalimlonjela, “Wone hegwe uwele ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi wilagaze kulawa hano mbaka hasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Kwa vila nayandichigwa, ‘Nguluwi kowalajiza wahilisi wa heye kwa chiwalo cha hegwe, leka wakwamile.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Na, ‘Wokuhola mmoko mwawo leka magulu ga hegwe galeche kikwang'hwala kuli iganga.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Hamba Yesu nakamwidichila, “Nayandichigwa, ‘Uleche kumjeza Mkulu Nguluwi wa hegwe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Limazoga vyolisindile kumjeza kwa chila nzila, hamba nalimleka mbaka mhela ukundigwe.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangwaluka mijito ja heye ako Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matei 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Malichi 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Hamba Yesu nakahiluka Galilaya yawele yamemile mong'ho wa Muhe Yelile, mbuli za heye nazenela Galilaya na kuli isi zeng'ha ziwele habehi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nakaluka kuwalangusa wanhu kuli masunagogi nakatogoligwa na weng'ha.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulemigwa ako Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matei 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Malichi 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yesu nakaluta Nasaleti, honhu hoyakulile, kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela nakenjila kuli sunagogi kota vyochiwele chihendo cha heye. Nakema leka yasome Maandiko Matakatifu kwa lizi. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Nakabochela chitabu cha mloli wa Nguluwi, Isaya. Nakagubula na kusoma honhu handichigwe hino!<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Muhe wa Mkulu, kahachanya ha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">kwa vila nakanyhagula heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">ndiwegalile wazunwa Mbuli Inojile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">nakandajiza ndiwadamlile wawele mchinweng'ho wodoholigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">wala wohambe walole, wolola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">na kuwalohola walingubunzwa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />na kudamla kota mhela naufika wa Mkulu kuwalohola wanhu wa heye.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Hamba nakachigubika chila chitabu, nakamha chitumagwa, nakekalisa hasi. Wanhu weng'ha wawele kuli sunagogi nawamnogolela meho. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Aho nakaluka kuwalonjela, “Maandiko Matakatifu, lehano nagenela kuli makutu ga hemwe.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Weng'ha nawanojezwa ng'hatu na heye, nawabubuwala kwa ulonzi unojile woyalonjile, naweuza “Ndaze! Ayu hawele mwana wa Yusufu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Naye nakawalonjela, “Ne majesa mondonjela ulonzi awu, ‘Mganga, wilohole gwegwe.’ Mbuli zeng'ha zotuhuliche nakudita Kapanaumu, uzidite hano haluga hako.” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Nakalutilila ngulonga, “Ndangulonga ndikomya, Mloli hotogoligwa hakaye hake. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Ila mhulichize, ndangukomya nakwali na wadala wenji walekwa kuli isi ya Isilaeli mhela wa Eliya. Mhela awo nhonya nahaitowile mhela wa miyaka jidatu na nusu, ahyo nakwali na lufemba kuli isi yeng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ahyo, Eliya hatumigwe kwa yoneche kuli Isilaeli ila kwa yafililwe na mlume wa heye wa Salefati kuli isi ya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kahi mhela wa Mloli Elisha nakwali na wanhu wenji wawele na uswema kuli isi ya Isilaeli, haduhu munhu yoneche yaloholigwe, ila Naamani mwenyenghaye wa isi ya Siliya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Wanhu weng'ha wawele kuli sunagogi lowahuliche ago nawazudila ng'hatu. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Nawema, nawamlavya Yesu hanze ya haluga hawo, na kumigala hachanya mchidunda wogana wamtoze hasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ila Yesu nakakola hagati howawele, nakaluta kaye.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yawele na chijeni chihile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Malichi 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Hamba Yesu nakadulika mbaka Kapanaumu, wilaya ya Galilaya, Zuwa lya Kwesela nakekala yowalangusa wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Nawabubuwala kwa ulanguso wa heye, kwa vila nayali yolangusa kota nayali na ludali. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mgati mwa sunagogi nakwali na munhu yawele na chijeni chihile, nakatowa iyowe kwa mong'ho yolonga. <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Kuna choni na hetwe, hegwe Yesu wa Nasaleti? Nakuya kutudumya? Natuvizela hegwe kwa whaani, hegwe kwa msenga Yelile yatumigwe na Nguluwi!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu nakachideuza acho chijeni yolonga, “Nyamalile! Ulawe kuli munhu ayu! Chila chijeni lochimgwisile hanyi yula munhu nachilawa ne kumdita chinhu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Wanhu weng'ha nawekala wabubuwale, nawelonjela “Aku kulangusa kwachi? Munhu ayu kana mong'ho na ludali lwa kuving'hanuchila vijeni vihile, navyo vyangumhulika.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ahyo mbuli za Yesu nazenela chila honhu kuli isi yila.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwosa utamwa wanhu wenji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matei 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Malichi 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu nakalawa kuli sunagogi, nakaluta kaye kwa Simoni, mamo yumwe, mkweye Simoni nayali yotamika lukami, nawamlanda Yesu yamusile utamwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu nakoya na kema habehi na mdala yula nakaudeuza ula utamwa, utamwa naumleka, baho mdala yula nakenuka na kwaluka kuwawichila chilyo.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Isanya lolyali lizinga, weng'ha wawele na watamwa wawo nawawegala kwa heye, naye nakawawichila moko gake mchanya chila yumwe na kawosela matamwa weng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Vijeni naviwalawa wanhu wenji, navyaluka kulonga, “Hegwe ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi!” Ila Yesu nakavideuza, nakavilemeza kulonga, navivizela kota heye nayali Kilistu Mlohozi.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangudamla ako Yudeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Malichi 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Mitondo kung'hali lufuku, Yesu nakoka nakaluta honhu kulihela wanhu. Wanhu nawali wompala chila honhu, lowamuwene nawajeza kumlemeza yaleche kuka. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ila heye nakawalonjela, “Nganigwa kudamla Mbuli Inojile ya Undewa wa Nguluwi kuli miji jiyage kahi, kwa vila achi ndo Nguluwi choyandajize.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ahyo nakalutilila kudamla kwa wanhu kuli masunagogi ga isi ya Yudeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwachema walanguswa walongole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matei 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Malichi 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Zuwa limwe, Yesu nayali yemile hafungo mwa ilamba lya Genesaleti, wanhu wenji nawali wamzungulute leka wahulichize ulonzi wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Nakajona mitumbwi mili jiwele hafungo ha ilamba, ila walowa somba nawali wochile, nawali wohovuga utandawala wa hewo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu nakenjila kuli itumbwi limwe lya Simoni, nakamlonjela yalihejeze kulawa hafungo mwa ilamba mbaka mmazi. Hamba nakekala mli itumbwi na kulangusa lung'hongola lwa wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Loyasindile kulangusa, nakamlonjela Simoni, “Ligale itumbwi mbaka hagati kuli mazi menji hamba mtoze utandawala wa hemwe mlowe somba.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni nakamwidichila, “Mkulu natujeza kulowa somba nechilo yeng'ha hatupatile ne chinhu ila kwa vila hegwe nakulonga, ndotoza utandawala.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Lowaditile ahyo nawalowa somba nyiji mbaka utandawala wa hewo nawaluka kudejeka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Nawawachema wayao wawele kuli itumbwi liyage leka woye wawatanze. Nawoya nawamemeza somba kuli mitumbwi jeng'ha mili mbaka najiwa behi kuzibila.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petili loyagawene aga, nakafugama hoyali Yesu kalonga, “Mkulu uche hali heni! Kwa vila ndina gehile!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni na wayage weng'ha nawabubuwala kwa vila nawapata somba nyinji. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Hihyo du Yakubu na Yohani, wana wa Sebedayo, wawele walowa hamwe na Simoni. Yesu nakamlonjela Simoni, “Uleche kudumba, kulawa sambi kowa mlowa wanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ahyo, lowajigale jila mitumbwi hafungo mwa ilamba nawaleka geng'ha, nawamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumusila munhu uswema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matei 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Malichi 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Nayali, Yesu loyawele kuli muji umwenga wa ako, munhu yumwe yawele na uswema kuli lukuli lweng'ha nakamona. Lelo, munhu ayo nakagwa chifunama nakamlanda Yesu, “Mkulu, wone ulingugana, koweza kunyheliza!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uswema wali utamwa umditile munhu aleche kumtambichila Nguluwi kwa vila nakoneka mwavu kuli meho ga Nguluwi. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu nakagolola moko, kamdoliza na kulonga, “Ndangugana welizwe!” Baho du ula uswema naumlawa. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Uleche kumlonjela ne munhu. Ila ulute kelajile kwa mtambika mkulu, ulavye nhambiko kwa chiwalo cha kwelizigwa kwa hegwe kota vyoyalajize Musa, leka wanhu weng'ha walavye ulolezi kota hegwe nakuloholigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ila Mbuli za Yesu nazenela chila honhu, wanhu wenji nawoya kumhulichiza na kusilwa matamwa gawo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ila heye nakaluta honhu hawele haduhu wanhu na kulanda ako.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumusa utamwa munhu yaziliche lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matei 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Malichi 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Zuwa limwe Yesu loyawele yolangusa. Mafalisayo na walangusa wa Malajizo ga Musa, kulawa chila chijiji cha Galilaya na Yudeya na Yelusalemu, nawali wekalise baho. Ludali lwa Mkulu nalwali hamwe na heye kwa kuwalohola watamwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Nawoya wanhu, wampapile munhu yaziliche kumwe, nawajeza kumwinjiza mng'handa wamuwiche kumwando kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ila nawalemwela kwinjila mng'handa kwa vila wanhu wenji nawali wekale. Ahyo nawamkwinhiza ayo yaziliche kuli chinduwiko, nawatubula chinduwiko, nawamdulisa ayo yaziliche hamwe na chinhanda cha heye, nawamuwika hagati hali lung'hongola lwa wanhu hali Yesu.<figure style="fig" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19">Wanhu wane walingumdulisa munhu kukolela chinduwiko</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu loyawene makundo ga hewo, nakamlonjela ayo munhu yaziliche, “Goloko kusilwa gehile ga hegwe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo nawaluka kiuza, “Ndo whaani muhu ayu yaligukovula? Haduhuli munhu yalinguweza kusa gehile ila Nguluwi yeka!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu nakavizela majesa ga hewo, nakawauza, “Lekachoni mwangijesa mnhumbula za hemwe? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Lyakohi liwele lya ubewe ng'hatu, Kulonga, ‘Kusilwa gehile ga hegwe,’ Ama kulonga, ‘Wime ujende?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ila ndangugana mvizele kota, Mwana wa munhu kana ludali lwa kuwosela wanhu gehile ga hewo kuli muisi.” Baho nakamlonjela yula yaziliche, “Winuche uhole chinhanda cha hegwe, ulute kaye!” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Lelo yula munhu yaziliche nakenuka hali hewo, nakedwika chinhanda cha heye na kaluta kaye, kuno yomtogola Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Wanhu weng'ha nawabubuwala ng'hatu na kudumba na kumtogola Nguluwi kuno wolonga, “Tuvyona vinduzanduza lehano.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumchema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matei 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Malichi 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Hamba, Yesu nakalawa kunze, nakamona mkongoza kodi yumwe yalinguchemigwa Lawi, yekalise mchituka cha kodi. Yesu nakamlonjela, “Umbinze!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Naye Lawi nakaleka chila chinhu, nakamuwinza. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Hamba Lawi nakamditila Yesu mnvina ng'hulu hakaye hake na chilundo cha wakongoza kodi na wanhu wanji nawekala hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ila Mafalisayo na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa nawawang'ung'utila walanguswa wa Yesu, wolonga, “Lekachoni mwangulya na kunwa na wakongoza kodi na wadita gehile?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Wanhu wawele wakomu hawalingumlapa mteleka mikwandi, ila wawele watamwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Suyile kuwachema wanhu wala wanojile, ila wala wawele na gehile leka wamgalamchile Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kwesela kulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matei 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Malichi 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Wanhu wanji nawamlonjela Yesu, “Walanguswa wa Yohani Mbatiza nawali wokwesela kulya na kulanda na vitumagwa wa Mafalisayo wanguditaga hiho, ila walanguswa wa hegwe wangulya na kunwa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Lelo wala walalikwe kuli mnvina ya kuhesa nawaganigwa kwesela kulya hanga mkasano yawele hamwe na hewo? Hebu! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ila mhela wokuya uwele mkasano kokusigwa kwa hewo. Aho ndo wokwesela kulya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu nakawalonjela nhelo ayi, “Haduhu munhu yalingudega chibende chinyale na kuhoneleza kuli nguwo ilalile. Wone yadite ahyo, koiwifya ila nguwo inyale, chila chilingulawa kuli nguwo inyale hachichiwhana na nguwo ilalile. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Haduhu munhu yowika divai ya lehano kuli vihako vya igozi vilalile. Kwa vila wone yadite ahyo, divai ya lehano yozatula vila vihako, divai yobohoka na vihako vyotulika. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Divai ya lehano yowichigwa kuli vihako vya igozi vinyale. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kuduhu munhu yalingugana kunwa divai inyale hala hoyosinda kunwa divai ya katali, ila kangulongaga, ‘Yila ya katali ndo inona lukami.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Zuwa lya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matei 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Malichi 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Zuwa limwe lya kwesela, Yesu na walanguswa wa heye nayali yokola mli migunda ja ngano. Walanguswa wa heye nawaluka kubena mibeleje ja ngano, nawalavya nyhule, nawalya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mafalisayo wamwenga nawawauza, “Lekachoni mwangudita mbuli hambe ikundigwe kudita kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu nakawedichila nakawalonjela, “Hamilanguse kwa Daudi na wayage lowawele na nzala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Heye nakenjila kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakahola mibumunda jilavigwe kwa Nguluwi nakalya na kuwapa wayage. Malajizo hambe gakundize wanhu wanji kulya mibumunda ajo, ila wakulu wa watambika hela.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ahyo Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mwana wa munhu ndo Mkulu wa Zuwa lya Kwesela.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yawele na moko uziliche.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matei 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Malichi 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Zuwa linji lya Zuwa lya Kwesela, Yesu nakenjila kuli sunagogi nakalangusa. Amo namwali na munhu yawele moko wa heye wa kudilo nauzilika. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wamwenga nawekala wopala chinhu cha kumlonjeleza Yesu. Ahyo nawali womlola wone komlohola munhu kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ila Yesu nakavizela gowalingijesa, nakamlonjela yula nayali na moko uziliche, “Winuche uye wime hano.” Yula munhu kaluta nakema hagati. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela. “Ndanguwauza, ndaze, yagoya kudita mbuli inojile ama mbuli yihile kuli zuwa lya kwesela, kulohola ukomu ama kudumya?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Nakawalola wanhu weng'ha wawele hala, nakamlonjela yula yaziliche moko, “Ugolole moko wa hegwe.” Naye nakagolola moko wa heye nakawa mkomu. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ila hewo nawazudila, nawelonjela ndaze vyowomditila Yesu mbuli yihile.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwahagula walanguswa kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matei 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Malichi 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Zuwa limwe Yesu nakaluta kuli chidunda kulanda, nahawasile nechilo yeng'ha yomlanda Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Vyokubwemwenzuche, nakawachema walanguswa wa heye, nakawahagula kumi na weli hali hewo wawele nakawachema watumigwa, <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />wawele ndo Simoni yamchemile Petili na Andeleya mng'holoze na Yakubu na Yohani na Filipo na Batolomeo na <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matei na Tomasi na Yakubu mwana wa Alufayo na Simoni yachemigwe Selote na <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yudasi mwana wa Yakubu na Yudasi Isikalioti yawele yamhinduche Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulangusa na kuwosela wanhu matamwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matei 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu loyeduliche hamwe na walanguswa wa heye mchidunda, Yesu nakema honhu hali ibalalika, hamwe na walanguswa wa heye na lung'hongola lwa wanhu walawile nzingo zeng'ha kulawa Yudeya na Yelusalemu na kulawa kuli mwhani ya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Weng'ha nawoya kumhulichiza Yesu na waloholigwa matamwa gawo. Wala walingugazigwa na vijeni vihile nakawalohola. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Wanhu weng'ha nawagana kumdoliza Yesu, kwa vila nawona mong'ho nawali ulawa mgati mwa heye kuwalohola weng'ha.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutambichizwa na kuchona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matei 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu nakawalola walanguswa wa heye, nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Namtambichizwa hemwe wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwa vila Undewa wa Nguluwi ndo wa hemwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Namtambichizwa hemwe muwele na nzala sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa vila mogutizwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Namtambichizwa hemwe muwele ngulila sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwa vila moseka.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Namtambichizwa hemwe, wanhu howokuzudilani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">howowabagulani na kuwaliga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">na kulilema itagwa lya hemwe kota ulonzi wihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">kwa chiwalo cha mwana wa munhu.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Msangalale na kuvina ago hogolawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:23">kwa vila chonolo chomuwichilwe kilanga ndo chikulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:23">Hihyo ndo wasekulu wa hewo nawawaditila waloli wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ila mochona hemwe muwele na lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwa vila mhela wa hemwe wa kusechelela naumala.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Mochona hemwe muwele miguta sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwa vila mowa na nzala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Mochona hemwe mlinguseka sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwa vila molombocheza na kulila!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Mochona hala wanhu howowatogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">kwa vila wasekulu wa hewo nawawaditila hiho waloli wa udesi.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muwagane wang'honyo wa hemwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matei 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Ila ndangukulonjela hemwe mlingunyhulichiza, muwagane wang'honyo wa hemwe, muwadile ganojile walinguwazudila. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Muwatambichize wala walinguwapanjilani, mlande kwa Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha walinguwaditila gehile. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Wone munhu yakutowe izeze limwe mgalamlile na lya keli. Wone munhu yakusukule ikoti mlechele yahole na igwanda. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Umhe chila yalingukulanda, wone munhu yahole lufufu lwako uleche kugana yakuhilulile. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Muwaditile wanji kota vyomlingugana wawaditile hemwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Wone mowagana wala walinguwagana hela, mopata chonolo chachi? Kwa vila wawele na gehile wanguwaganaga wala walinguwagana. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Wone mowaditila ganojile wala wawele nguwaditila hemwe ganojile mopata chonolo chachi? Kwa vila wehile wanguditaga hiho. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Wone muwaziche kwa wala muwele na makundo na hewo kota wowahilusila, lelo mopata chonolo chachi? Kwa vila wawele na gehile wangwazikaga kwa wawele na gehile leka wahilusilwe hihila. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ila muwagane wang'honyo wa hemwe, muwaditile ganojile, muwaziche kwa hewo ne kitumbila kota mohilusilwa, aho chonolo cha hemwe chowa chikulu, namwe mowa wana wa Yawele Kuchanya Ng'hatu, kwa vila heye kana isungu na wala wohambe walonje malumbo na wehile. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Muwe na isungu kota mhaza wa hemwe vyoyawele na isungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwatagusa wanji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matei 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Mleche kuwatagusa wanji, namwe hamtagusigwa, mleche kuwag'ung'utila wanji namwe hamng'ung'utilwa. Muwalechele wanji namwe molechelwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Muwape wanhu vinhu, namwe mopegwa. Chipimilo chimemile lukami, chibatililwe mbaka kubohoka. Kwa vila chipimilo chichila chomlinguwapimila wanji ndo Nguluwi kotumiya kwa hemwe.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu kawalonjela nhelo ayi, “Ndaze, yohambe yalole komlongoza yohambe yalole miyage? Hebu! Weng'ha weli wogwa kuli ikulubila. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mlanguswa hambe yamsinde mlangusa wa heye, ila yalanguswe goya na kusinda, koweza kuwa kota mlangusa wa heye.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Lekachoni kwanguchona chibadu kuli iziho lya mng'holozo, ne hambe uyone boliti kuli iziho lya hegwe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Koweza ndaze kumlonjela mng'holozo, ‘Mng'holozangu, ndikuse chibadu chiwele kuli iziho lyako,’ kuno hambe uyone boliti iwele kuli iziho lya hegwe? Kwa mdesi hegwe! Tandi use boliti iwele kuli iziho lyako aho koweza kulavya chibadu chiwele kuli iziho lya mng'holozo.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igodi lyanguzeleka kwa mafuza gake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matei 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Igodi linojile halilelaga mafuza gehile, ne haduhu igodi lihile lilingulela mafuza ganojile. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Chila igodi lyozeleka kwa mafuza gake. Kwa vila wanhu hambe wabawe tini kuli miwa ne zabibu kuli michongoma. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Munhu yanojile kangulavya ganojile, gawichigwe mnhumbula mwa heye na munhu yehile kangulavya gehile kulawa mnhumbula ya heye, kwa vila munhu kangulongaga gala gamemile mnhumbula ya heye.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yalinguzenga yawele na luhala na yalinguzenga mpoka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matei 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Lekachoni mwangunyhema, ‘Mkulu, Mkulu’ Kuno hambe mdite gondilinguwalonjela? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Ndowalajila ndaze vyoyawele munhu yalinguya kwa heni, yahuliche ulonzi wa heni na kweneza. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ayo nakewhana na munhu yazenjile ng'handa, yabawile hanyi ng'hatu ne kuwika msisi kuli italawe. Mazi tendema hogofichile, mazi nagaitowa yila ng'handa ila haitigasiche, kwa vila naizenjigwa goya. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ila yoneche yalinguhulika ulonzi wa heni ne yaleche kuukolela mijito, ayo nakewhana na munhu yazenjile ng'handa hali sangalaza ne msisi. Mazi tendema ga lwanda nagoya, mazi nagaitowa yila ng'handa naigwa na kuwifigwa ng'hatu!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumusila utamwa chitumagwa wa chilongozi wa Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matei 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu loyasindile kulonga aga geng'ha kuno wanhu wangumuhulichiza, nakaluta Kapanaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ako nakwali na chilongozi wa wamizi, nayali na chitumagwa yamganile ng'hatu. Ayo chitumagwa nayali yotamika behi kubagama.<figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Mkulu wa wamizi wa Waloma</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Chilongozi ayo loyahuliche mbuli za Yesu nakawalajiza wasekulu wa Yuda walute kumlanda yoye yamusile utamwa chitumagwa wa heye. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Lowafichile kwa Yesu, nawamdedeza ng'hatu, nawalonga, “Munhu ayu kanguganigwa yaditilwe mbuli ayo, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kwa vila kanguwagana wanhu wa isi ya hetwe na ndo yatuzenjele lila sunagogi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yesu nakaluta hamwe na hewo. Loyawele behi kufika kuli ng'handa ya yula chilongozi, ayo chilongozi nakawalajiza goloko wa heye wamlonjele Yesu, “Mkulu, leche kitunya, kwa vila hambe iganigwe hegwe kwinjila kuli ng'handa ya heni. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Kwa chiwalo acho siwezile kuya kwa hegwe. Ila ulonje ulonzi hela naye chitumagwa wa heni kowa mkomu. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kwa vila heni nda munhu ndiwele hali ludali, mbele na wamizi wawele hali ludali lwa heni. Hondimlonjela ayu, ‘Ulute.’ Heye kangulutaga na yunji hondimlonjela, ‘Uye.’ Kanguyaga. Hondimlonjela chitumagwa wa heni, ‘Udite ahi.’ Kanguditaga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu loyahuliche ulonzi awo, nakabubuwala. Nakalugalamchila lula lung'hongola, nakalulonjela, “Sinamona munhu yawele na makundo kota aga kuli isi yeng'ha ya Isilaeli.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Wala wanhu lowafichile kaye nawamfika yula chitumagwa yawele mkomu.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumzilipula mwana wa yafililwe na mlume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Hamba Yesu nakaluta kuli muji umwenga ulinguchemigwa Naini nawo walanguswa wa heye na chilundo chikulu cha wanhu nawaluta hamwe na heye. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Hoyawele habehi na lwizi lwa muji, naketing'hana na wanhu wawele wapichile mtufi wa mlume yawele ndo mwana wa udewele wa yafililwe na mlume. Wanhu wenji kuli muji awo nawali na ayo mamo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mkulu loyamuwene ayo mamo nakamonela isungu, nakamlonjela, “Uleche kulila.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Hamba nakaluta nakachidoliza chinhanda cha kupapila mtufi, wala wapichile nawema. Hamba nakalonga, “Msongolo! Ndangukulonjela, winuche!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Yula yabagame nakenuka, nakekalisa, nakaluka kulonga. Hamba Yesu nakampa mayake. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Wanhu weng'ha nawamdumba Nguluwi, nawamtogola Nguluwi wolonga, “Mloli mkulu nakalawa kwa hetwe. Nguluwi nakoya kuwalohola wanhu wa heye.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Mbuli azo nazenela kweng'ha hali Yudeya na kuli isi za habehi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasenga kulawa kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matei 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Walanguswa wa Yohani Mbatiza nawamlonjela Yohani mbuli zeng'ha. Ahyo Yohani nakawachema walanguswa wa heye weli mwa wala walanguswa wa heye kawalonjela, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />nakawalajiza kwa Mkulu leka wamuuze, “Hegwe ndo yula yalinguya, ama tumbeteze yunji?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Wala walanguswa lowafichile kwa Yesu nawamlonjela, “Yohani Mbatiza nakatulajiza kwa hegwe tukuuze, ‘Hegwe ndo yula yalinguya, ama tumbeteze yunji?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mhela awo, Yesu nakawosela matamwa wanhu wenji walingugazigwa na matamwa na wawele na vijeni na wanhu wenji wohambe walole wangulola. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Lelo, Yesu nakawedichila, “Mlute mkamlonjele Yohani gala gomgahuliche na kugona na wohambe walole wangulola na vyete wangujenda wawele na uswema wangwelizwa na wohambe wahuliche wanguhulika na wabagame wanguzilipuka na wazunwa wangudamlilwa Mbuli Inojile. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Nakatambichizwa munhu yula yohambe yazudizwe na heni!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Aho wasenga wa Yohani lowochile, Yesu nakaluka kuwalonjela wanhu wenji wamemile, kuwala Yohani, nakawauza “Namluta kula kuchiwala, namluta kulola choni? Ndaze, ndo misolo jilinguwembeluswa na mbeho? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ama hebu, nakuluta kulola choni? Namluta kumlola munhu yavalile mivalo jinojile? Hebu! Wanhu wawele nguvala mivalo jinojile na kikala kwa ung'hondwa wa kuli ng'handa za undewa! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Lelo mndonjele, namluta kulola choni? Namluta kumlola mloli? Ena! Heye ndo mzidi wa mloli. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ayu ndo yalingulonjigwa kuli Maandiko Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">“ ‘Mlole, ndangumlajiza msenga wa heni yakulongole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">yawele kokuwichila goya nzila ya hegwe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu nakasinda kwa kulonga, “Ndangukulonjelani, hali wanhu weng'ha haduhu yawele mkulu ng'hatu kusinda Yohani Mbatiza. Ne ahyo, yula yawele mdodo ng'hatu kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi ndo mkulu kusinda heye.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Wanhu weng'ha mbaka wakongoza kodi lowahuliche ago, nawakutogola kunoga kwa Nguluwi, awo ndo wala nawakunda kubatizigwa na Yohani. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ila Mafalisayo na wala wavizelele goya Malajizo ga Musa nawalema kumhulichiza Nguluwi, kwa vila nawalema kubatizigwa na Yohani.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu nakalonga, “Ndiwawhanize na choni wanhu wa lulelo alu? Wangiwhana na choni? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Hewo ndo kota wana wekale kuli soko wochichema na kilonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">“ ‘Natuwatowela mluli ila hamvinile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">Ne hamlilile hala hotwimbile zimbo za kulombocheza.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />“Kwa vila Yohani Mbatiza nakoya, nayali yokwesela kulya na hanwele divai, namwe namlonga, ‘Kana chijeni!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Naye mwana wa munhu nakoya, nakalya na kunwa hemwe na hemwe, mwangulonga, ‘Mlole ayu yalingulya ng'hatu na yalingugala, goloko wa wakongoza kodi na wawele na gehile.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ila luhala lwa Nguluwi loneka lunoga kwa wala weng'ha walinguikunda!”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdala yawele na gehile kangulechelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mfalisayo yumwe nakamlalika Yesu kulya chilyo kwa heye. Ahyo Yesu nakenjila kuli ng'handa ya Mfalisayo, nakekalisa kulya chilyo. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Kuli ula mji nakwali na mamo yawele na gehile. Loyahuliche kota Yesu ka haluga ha Mfalisayo, nakahola chupa ya alabasta iwele na unhunyililo. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Nakoya, nakema habehi hali magulu ga Yesu kuno yolila na mahozi gake nagamlagalila Yesu kuli magulu. Ayo mdala nakagabagusa magulu ga Yesu kwa mnvili zake. Hamba nakaganonela na kugabakaliza wula unhunyililo. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Yula Mfalisayo yamlaliche Yesu loyonile ago, nakejesa mnhumbula, “Wone munhu ayu yahawele mloli yahavizele kota mdala ayu kandaze, kana gehile!” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu nakamlonjela ayo Mfalisayo, “Simoni ndina chinhu cha kukulonjela.” Heye Simoni nakamlonjela, “Ena mlangusa ndonjele.” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu nakaluka kulonga, “Nakwali na munhu yaziche sendi kwa wanhu weli, yumwe nayali yamwaziche sendi migwala miya zihano na yunji sendi migwala makumi gahano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Lowalemwele kuhilusa sendi azo, ayo munhu nakawalechela weng'ha weli. Yalikohi hali hewo weli komgana ng'hatu ayo mkulu?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni nakedichila, “Ndangijesa kota ndo yula yalechelwe sendi nyinji ng'hatu.” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Goya.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Hamba kagalamka kwa yula mdala kalonga, “Simoni kwangumona ayu mdala? Heni honyinjile aha haluga hako humhele mazi ga kuhovujila magulu gangu, ila mdala ayu kanyhovuga magulu gangu na mahozi gake na kumbagusa na mnvili za heye. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Hegwe hundamse kwa kunonela, ila kwaluchila hala honyinjile, mdala ayu halechile kuganonela magulu ga heni. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Hegwe humbakalize heni mafuta kumutwi, ila heye nakagabakaliza magulu ga heni unhunyililo. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ahyo ndangukulonjela, nakalechelwa gehile ga heye gawele menji, kwa vila nakalajila igano ng'hatu. Ila yula yalechelwe hado, kanguganaga hado hela.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Hamba nakamlonjela yula mdala, “Nakulechelwa gehile ga hegwe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Ila wala wawele hamwe mchisaga naweuza, “Ayu ndo whaani yalinguweza kulechela gehile ga munhu?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesu nakamlonjela yula mdala, “Makundo ga hegwe gakulohola, ulute kwa kikala goya.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Wadala welongoze na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ago logapulute, Yesu nakakola kuli miji na vijiji yodamla Mbuli Inojile ya Undewa wa Nguluwi. Wala walangusa kumi na weli nawelongoza naye <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na wadala wamwe wawele Yesu nakawosela vijeni na matamwa, nawelongoza hamwe na heye. Hali hewo nayali Maliya yachemigwe Madelena, yula nayosigwe vijeni saba <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />na Yohana mdala wa Kusa, mkola mijito mng'hangala wa Helodi na Susana na wadala wanji wenji wawele womkolela mijito Yesu kwa lufufu lwao.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana kwa yalingunyala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matei 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Malichi 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Mhela umwe lung'hongola nalwali lukuya kwa Yesu kulawa kuli chila muji, nakalulonjela nhelo ayi. <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Yalingunyala nakaluta kunyala nyhadikwa, loyawele yonyala, zinji nazigwa habehi na nzila, nazibijigwa, videje vya kilanga navilya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Zinji nazigwa hali mitalawe, lozotile nazikala kwa kuwahela mazi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Zinji nazigwa hali miwa, jila miwa najikula hamwe na ajo mizuchila ja nyhadikwa na kujipilinjila mizuchila ja nyhadikwa azo. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Zinji nazigwa hali misanga jiligoya nazota na kulela ng'hatu!” Loyasindile kulonga ago, nakalonga kwa lizi likulu, “Yawele na makutu ga kuhulichiza, yahuliche!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwalo cha kulangusa kwa nhelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matei 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Malichi 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Walanguswa nawamuuza Yesu, “Nhelo ayi ina mana yachi?” <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Heye nakawedichila, “Hemwe nampegwa kuvizela uviso wa Undewa wa Nguluwi, ila kwa wanji ndangulonga kwa nhelo hanga wangulola waleche kona na howohulika waleche kuvizela.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwatang'hulila nhelo ya yalingunyala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matei 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Malichi 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Lelo mana ya nhelo ayi ndo, nyhadikwa ndo ulonzi wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Zila zigwile mnzila zangulajila wala wanhu wawelenguhulika ulonzi wa Nguluwi hamba Limazoga lyanguya lyangusa ulonzi awo mnhumbula za hewo leka waleche kukunda na kuloholigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Zila zigwile hali italawe ndo wala walinguubochela ulonzi kwa kusangalala hala howohulika, ila wahela mizabi. Wangukunda kwa mhela uchefu hela, houfika mhela wa kujezigwa wangulekaga kukunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Zila zigwile hali miwa ndo wala walinguhulika ila howolutilila wangutunyigwa na kikala kwa hewo, lufufu na ung'hondwa, nawo wangulela mafuza ila hambe gakangale. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Zila zigwile mli misanga jinojile, ndo wala wanhu wawelenguhulika ulonzi, wangibatilila mnhumbula, awo wangwimilila mbaka wangulela mafuza.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhelo kuwala chenje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Malichi 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Wanhu hawawesaga chenje na kuchigubika na chidoto ama kuwika mlukweme lwa chinhanda. Ila wanguwikaga kuli honhu ha kuwichila chenje leka wala walingwinjila mng'handa wone lumuli. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Kwa vila chila chinhu chivisigwe chowichigwa hazelu na uviso woneche wozeleka. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Lelo milolele ndaze vyomlinguhulika, kwa vila yawele na chinhu kokonjezelwa, ila yula yalihela chinhu, mbaka chila choyalingijesa kanacho choholigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamo na wang'holoze Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matei 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Malichi 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Aho mamo na wang'holoze Yesu nawamuyila, ila nawalemwela kumhejelela habehi kwa vila wanhu nawamema lukami. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Munhu yumwe nakamlonjela Yesu, “Mayako na wang'holozo wakunze wangugana wakone.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />“Ila Yesu nakamwidichila, mayangu na wang'holozangu ndo wala walinguhulika ulonzi wa Nguluwi na kibatilila.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguidita nhigu isindamale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matei 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Malichi 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Zuwa limwe Yesu nakakwina mli itumbwi hamwe na walanguswa wa heye, kawalonjela, “Tuloche tulute mbaka kumwambu mwa ilamba.” Nawo nawaluka kuluta. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Lowawele woluta mli itumbwi, Yesu nakawasa. Nhigu ng'hulu nailawila kuli ilamba mbaka itumbwi nalyali limema mazi, nawo nawali habehi kudumigwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Walanguswa nawamlutila Yesu na wamwinula wolonga, “Mkulu, Mkulu! Twangudumigwa!” Yesu nakenuka kaideuza yila nhigu, baho naileka, nakuwa tulu! <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yesu nakawauza, “Gakohi makundo ga hemwe?” Ila hewo nawabubuwala na kudumba kuno wochilonjela, “Ayu ndo whaani mbaka nhigu ng'hulu yangumhulichiza?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola munhu yawele na chijeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matei 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Malichi 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu nawalanguswa wa heye nawalutilila na majendo. Nawafika mwhani ya isi ya Wagelasi iwele kumwambu kwa ilamba lya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Loyawele yodulika mwhani, munhu yumwe wa muji wula yawele na vijeni, kwa mhela winji nayali hambe yavale nguwo ne kikala haluga, ila nakekala kuli vilaga. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Loyamuwene Yesu nakatowa iyowe, naketoza hanyi hali Yesu na kulonga kwa lizi likulu, “Kuna choni na heni, Yesu Mwana wa Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya Ng'hatu? Ndangukulanda uleche kungaza!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Nakalonga ahyo mhela Yesu loyavilonjele avyo vijeni vilawe kwa munhu ayo. Vijeni avyo navyali vimuyila ayo munhu mala nyinji hanga wanhu nawamuwika mng'handa na kumuwoha minyololo na pingu, ila nakavidumula vihindo avyo na kuhilikwa kuchiwala na vijeni avyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Lelo Yesu nakamuuza, “itagwa lyako kwa whaani?” Heye nakedichila, “itagwa lyangu chilundo cha wamizi.” Kwa vila nayali yenjilwe na vijeni vinji. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Avyo vijeni navimdedeza uleche kutugala kuli ikulubila.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Honhu hala nahali na chilundo cha migubi chilingudimigwa mchidunda. Lelo, avyo vijeni navimdedeza Yesu yavikundize vinjile kuli migubi. Naye Yesu nakavikundiza. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Avyo vijeni navimlawa yula munhu, navinjila kuli migubi, chila chilundo cha migubi najifiduka kuli chiduliko ching'ang'ale na kwinjila kuli ilamba lya mazi, najibagama.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Wala wadimi wawele wodima chila chilundo cha migubi vyowawene galawile, nawabilima, nawaluta kuwalonjela wanhu wawele kuli muji na kuli migunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Wanhu nawaluta kulola galawile, lowafichile hoyali Yesu, nawamfika yula munhu yalavigwe vijeni yekalise habehi na Yesu yawele yavalile nguwo na yawele na luhala, nawadumba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Wala wanhu wowagawene ago nawawalonjela wanhu wanji ndaze yula munhu yawele na vijeni vyoyaloholigwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Aho wanhu weng'ha wa isi ya Wagelasi nawamlanda Yesu yoche kwa hewo kwa vila nawali na lunhwinhwi. Lelo Yesu nakenjila kuli itumbwi, nakoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Yula munhu yalavigwe vijeni nakamdedeza Yesu walutase, ila Yesu hakundile, ila nakamlonjela, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Hiluche kaye kawalonjele geng'ha Nguluwi goyakuditile.” Yula munhu nakaluta, nakadamla kuli muji weng'ha kuwala mbuli zoyaditilwe na Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhinza kanguzilipuligwa na mdala kanguloholigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matei 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Malichi 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu loyahiluche, ikugusi lya wanhu nalimbochela kwa kusangalala kwa vila nalyali limbeteza. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Hamba munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Jailo chilongozi wa sunagogi, nakoya na kugwa hali magulu ga Yesu, nakamlanda yalute kaye kwa heye, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwa vila mhinza wa heye wa udewele yawele na miyaka kumi na mili, nayali habehi kubagama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu loyawele yoluta, ikugusi lya wanhu nalimzunguluta chila nzingo. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Lelo nakwali na mdala hali lila ikugusi, yawele nayali na utamwa wa kulawa danda kwa miyaka kumi na mili, hanga nayali nakalavya sendi nyinji kwa walaguzi, ila haduhu yamlohole. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ayo mdala nakamuwinza Yesu kumbele, nakadoliza lupembo lwa nguwo ya heye. Baho du nakaloholigwa utamwa wa heye wa kulawa danda. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu nakauza, “Ndo whaani yandolize?” Wanhu weng'ha lowalemile, Petili nakalonga, “Mkulu ikugusi ali nalikuzunguluta chila nzingo.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ila Yesu nakalonga, “Ka baha munhu yandolize, kwa vila nandivizela kota mong'ho wa heni naundawa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Yula mdala loyavizele kota hambe yaweze kivisa, nakoya yokakama, naketoza hali magulu ga Yesu. Nakalonga hali wanhu weng'ha lekachoni nakamdoliza na ndaze vyoyaloholigwe baho du. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Lelo Yesu nakamlonjela, “Mhinza, makundo ga hegwe gakulohola. Ulute kwa kikala goya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu loyawele yang'hali yodawala, nakoya chitumagwa kulawa kuli ng'handa ya Jailo, yula chilongozi wa sunagogi, nakamlonjela, “Mhinza wa hegwe nakabagama. Uleche kumtunya Mlangusa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Yesu loyahuliche ago nakamlonjela Jailo, “Uleche kudumba, ukunde naye kowa mkomu.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Loyafichile kaye kwa Jailo hamkundize munhu yoneche kwinjila mg'handa hamwe na heye, ila Petili na Yakobo na Yohani na mhaza na mamo wa ayo mhinza. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Mhela wuwula wanhu weng'ha nawali wolila na kulombocheza kwa chiwalo cha ayo mhinza. Yesu nakawalonjela, “Mleche kulila kwa vila ayu mwana habagame ila kawasa hela!” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Hewo nawaseka kwa kumbeza heye kwa vila nawavizela kota yula mwana nakabagama. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Yesu nakamibata moko yula mhinza na kulonga, “Mhinza, winuche!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Muhe wa heye naumuyila kahi, baho du nakenuka. Yesu nakawalonjela wamhe heye chilyo. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Mhaza na mamo wa heye nawabubuwala ng'hatu, ila Yesu kawalonjela waleche kumlonjela munhu yoneche gala galawile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalajiza walanguswa kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matei 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Malichi 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu nakawachema wala walanguswa wa heye kumi na weli na kawapa mong'ho na ludali lwa kulavya vijeni na kuwosela wanhu matamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Hamba nakawalajiza walute kudamla mbuli ya Undewa wa Nguluwi na kuwosela wanhu matamwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Nakawalonjela, “Lomkuka mleche kuhola chinhu choneche chila, mleche kuhola ng'hweku ne mhako ne chilyo ne sendi ne igwanda lya keli. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Kuli ng'handa yoneche yomkwinjila na kubocheligwa, mikale mumo mbaka lomkuka kuli muji awo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Wone waleche kuwabochela mlawe kuli muji awo, lomkuka mkung'hune nhimbwisi iwele mmagulu genu leka uwe ulolezi wa kuwapanjila hewo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Lelo walanguswa nawaluka majendo, nawakola kuli vijiji wodamla Mbuli Inojile na kuwosela wanhu matamwa chila honhu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Helodi kangudumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matei 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Malichi 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Lelo Helodi mndewa wa Galilaya nakahulika mbuli zeng'ha lozilawile, nayali na lunhwinhwi kwa vila wanhu nawali wolonga kota Yohani Mbatiza nakazilipuka kulawa kwa wabagame. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Wanji nawalonga Eliya nakalawila na wanji nawalonga yumwe wa waloli wa katali nakazilipuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ila mndewa Helodi nakalonga, “Ayo Yohani nandimdumula mutwi. Lelo ndo whaani ayo yondilinguhulika mbuli za heye?” Nakawa na maya ya kumona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwapa chilyo wanhu elufu zihano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matei 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Malichi 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Wala watumigwa lowahiluche, nawamlonjela Yesu chila chinhu chowaditile. Yesu kawahola, nakaluta nawo chinyele mbaka kuli muji ulinguchemigwa Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ila wanhu lowavizelele koyalutile, nawamuwinza. Yesu nakawabochela, nakalonga nawo kuwala mbuli za Undewa wa Nguluwi, kawalohola wala waganile kuloholigwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Isanya lolyaluche kuzinga, wala walanguswa kumi na weli nawaluta na kumlonjela, “Walonjele wanhu walute kuli vijiji na migunda ja habehi, leka wapale chilyo na honhu ha kuwasa kwa vila aha hotuli twa kuchiwala.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ila Yesu nakawedichila, “Muwape chilyo walye.” Hewo nawamwidichila, “Twahela mzidi wa mibumunda jihano na somba mbili. Hanji tulute tukagule chilyo cha kwenela wanhu weng'ha!” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Wawele aho ndo walume elufu zihano. Yesu kawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Muwalonjele wanhu wekalise kuli vilundo vya wanhu makumi gahano chila chilundo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Wala walanguswa wadita ahyo, nawawadita wanhu weng'ha nawekala. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Hamba Yesu nakajihola jila mibumunda jihano na zila somba mbili, nakalola kilanga, nakavitambichiza na kuvimogola. Hamba nakawapa walanguswa wa heye leka wawagawile wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Wanhu weng'ha nawalya, naweguta. Nawakungajiza chilyo chisigale, vimema vikowe kumi na vili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kangukunda Yesu ndo Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matei 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Malichi 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Zuwa limwenga Yesu loyawele yomlanda Nguluwi yaliyeka, walanguswa wa heye nawali habehi na heye. Lelo nakawauza, “Wanhu wangulonga kota heni nda whaani?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Nawo nawamwidichila, “Wanji wangulonga kota hegwe ndo Yohani Mbatiza, wanji wangulonga kota hegwe ndo Eliya na wanji wangulonga kota kwa yumwe wa waloli wa katali yazilipuche.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Hamba nakawauza, “Namwe mwangulonga heni nda whaani?” Petili nakedichila, “Hegwe ndo Kilistu Mlohozi yahaguligwe na Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga kuwala kugazigwa na kukopoligwa kwa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matei 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Malichi 8:30-9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela waleche kumlonjela munhu yoneche mbuli ayo. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesu nakalonga, “Naimgana Mwana wa munhu kugazigwa ng'hatu na kulemigwa na wasekulu na vilongozi wa watambika na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa. Koganigwa yakopoligwe, ila zuwa lya kadatu kozilipuka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Hamba nakawalonjela weng'ha, “Munhu yoneche yogana kumbinza heni yangumgana yeleme yuye, yahole chiwambilo cha heye chila zuwa, yambinze. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kwa vila munhu yoneche yogana kuulohola ukomu wa heye kowajiliza, ila yoneche yowajiliza ukomu wa heye kwa chiwalo cha heni koulohola. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ndaze, hana mzidi wachi kwa munhu kupata lufufu lweng'ha lwa isi kwa kiyajiliza ama kidumya yuye? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Wone munhu kombonela soni na malanguso ga heni, naye Mwana wa munhu komonela soni mhela hoyokuya kuli welile wa heye na wa mhaza na wa wahilisi welile wa kilanga. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ndikomya ndangukulonjelani, hana wanhu wanji hano hawobagama kung'hali kuwona Undewa wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumeho kwa Yesu kwangugalamka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matei 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Malichi 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Mazuwa nane hamba, Yesu loyasindile kulonga mbuli azo, Yesu nakawahola Petili na Yohani na Yakubu, nakaluta nawo kuli chidunda kulanda. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Loyawele yolanda, kumeho kwa heye nakugaluka na mivalo ja heye najiwa mizelu ng'hatu! <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Baho nawoneka wanhu weli wolongasa naye. Wanhu awo ndo Musa na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />wawele na welile, nawalonga naye kuwala kubagama kwa heye kuwele kolawila ako Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petili na wayage nawali wawasile ng'hatu, lowalilimche nawona welile wa Yesu na wala wanhu weli wawele wemile hamwe na heye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Lelo wanhu awo weli lowawele wokuka, Petili nakamlonjela Yesu, “Mkulu, ya goya hetwe kikala hano! Lelo tuzenje vibumuli vidatu, chimwe cha hegwe na chimwe cha Musa na chimwe cha Eliya.” Ila Petili nahavizelele choyalingulonga.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Petili loyalutilile kulonga ago, ng'hungugu nailawila na kuwagubika, nawo nawadumba ng'hatu lowagubikwe na ng'hungugu ayo. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Lizi nalilawa kuli yila ng'hungugu, nalilonga, “Ayu ndo mwana wa heni yondimhagule, mumhulichize.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Vyowahuliche lizi alo, Yesu nakoneka yawele yaliyeka. Walanguswa nawanyamalila kuwala mbuli ayo ne kumlonjela munhu yoneche gala galawile.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola msongolo yawele na chijeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matei 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Malichi 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Mitondo lowaduliche kulawa kuli chidunda, naweting'hana na lung'hongola lwa wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Munhu yumwe kuli lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu nakakwiniza lizi, nakalonga, “Mlangusa, ndangukulanda umlole mwana wa heni, kwa vila ndo mwana wa heni wa udewele. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mala nyinji chijeni changumtunya na kumdita yatowe iyowe, hamba changumgwisaga na kumdita yalavye ifulo kumlomo. Acho chijeni changumgaza ng'hatu ne kumleka. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nandiwalanda walanguswa wa hegwe wachilavye chijeni acho, ila nawalemwela.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Hemwe ulelo lulihela makundo na lwajilile! Ndochikala na hemwe na kuwemilila mbaka nili? Migale mwanago hano.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mhela msongolo ayo loyawele yokuya kwa Yesu, chila chijeni nachimgwisa na kumlavya ifulo kumlomo. Ila Yesu nakaching'hanuchila chila chijeni nakamlohola yula msongolo na kumhilula kwa mhaza wa heye. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Wanhu weng'ha nawabubuwala kwa kona ukulu wa Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu kangulonga kahi mbuli ya kubagama kwa heye</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matei 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Malichi 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Wala wanhu lowawele wang'hali wabubuwale kwa chiwalo cha mbuli zeng'ha zoyaditile, Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Mhulichize goya gano gondiwalonjela sambi. Mwana wa munhu kobelenhukwa na kowichigwa kuli moko ga wanhu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ila hewo hawavizelele mana ya uviso wa ulonzi awo. Kwa vila ulonzi awo nauvisigwa kwa hewo leka waleche kuvizela, nawo nawadumba kumuuza Yesu kuwala ulonzi awo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Whaani yawele mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matei 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Malichi 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Nakwali na kitwanza hali walanguswa kuwala ndo whaani hali hewo kowa mkulu kusinda weng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Ila Yesu nakagazela majesa ga hewo, naye nakamhola mwana, nakamuwika habehi na heye. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Hamba nakawalonjela, “Munhu yoneche yalingumbochela mwana ayu mdodo kwa itagwa lya heni, kangumbochela heni na munhu yoneche yalingumbochela heni, kangumbochela yula yandajize. Kwa vila yula yawele mdodo kusinda weng'ha hali hemwe ndo yawele mkulu kusinda weng'ha.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohambe yetwanze na hemwe ka ubanzi wa hemwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Malichi 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohana nakamlonjela Yesu, “Mkulu natumona munhu yolavya chijeni kwa itagwa lya hegwe, natwe natumlemeza kwa vila heye hawele yumwe wa hetwe.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ila Yesu nakalonga, “Mleche kumlemeza! Kwa vila yohambe yetwanze na hemwe ka ubanzi wa hemwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Samaliya wangulema kumbochela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Mhela louwele habehi wa Yesu kuholigwa kilanga, nakamula kuluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Lelo nakawalajiza wasenga wamlongole, nawo nawaluta kuli chijiji cha Samaliya leka wamuwichile goya chila chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ila wenyeng'haye hawambochele kwa vila nayali yoluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Walanguswa wa heye, wawele ndo Yohana na Yakubu lowagawene ago nawamuuza Yesu, “Mkulu, kwangugana tuchilonjele chiluli kulawa kilanga chiwadulichile na kuwalakaza?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ila heye nakawagalamchila, nakawadeuza. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Nawalawa, nawaluta kuli chijiji chiyage.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walinguganigwa kumuwinza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matei 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Lowawele mmajendo munhu yumwe nakamlonjela Yesu, “Ndokuwinza koneche kouluta.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Mikanhu jina mhalika na videje vya kilanga vina vimvulila ila Mwana wa munhu kahela honhu ha kwesela.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Hamba Yesu nakamlonjela munhu yunji, “Umbinze.” Ila munhu ayo nakalonga, “Mkulu ng'hundize tandi ndute ndikamtile mhaza wa heni.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Waleche wabagame wawatile wabagame wa hewo, ila hegwe ulute kadamle Undewa wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Munhu yunji nakamlonjela, “Ndokuwinza, ila ng'hundize ndikawalaje wang'holozangu kaye.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Munhu yoneche yalingibata ihuka yawele goya kulima kuno yolola kumbele, hambe yaganigwe kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalajiza wanhu makumi saba na weli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Hamba, Mkulu nakawahagula wanhu wanji makumi saba na weli, nakawalajiza weliweli, wamlongole kuli chila muji na chila honhu hoyaganile kuluta. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nakawalonjela, “Mbena nyinji, ila wakola mijito ndo wachefu. Ahyo mumlande Mkulu wa mena yalajize wakola mijito kuli mgunda wa heye mbena. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Lelo mluteni, ndanguwalajiza hemwe kota miyana ming'holo kuli mibwa ja kisolo. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mleche kuhola sendi ne mhako ne makwamba na mleche kumlamsa munhu yoneche mnzila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Kuli ng'handa yoneche yila yomkwinjila, mlongole na kuwalamsa ahi, ‘Mikale goya mng'handa yino.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Wone kuwe na munhu yawele na kikala goya, kikala goya kowa hamwe na heye, wone hebu kikala goya kokuhiluchilani. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mikale kuli ng'handa yiyo, mulye na kunwa vyowalinguwapa, kwa vila chila mkola mijito kanguganigwa kupegwa chasi kwa kiwhana na mijito joyakolile. Mleche kulabajila kulawa ng'handa imwe mbaka iyage. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Wone mfiche kuli muji na wanhu wa muji awo wawabochele, mulye choneche chomlingupegwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Muwosele matamwa wali kuli muji awo na muwalonjele, ‘Undewa wa Nguluwi wa habehi.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ila wone mwinjile kuli muji na wanhu waleme kuwabochela, mlawe mlute kuli nzila zake mlonje, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Mbaka nhimbwisi za muji wa hemwe inhanhahile kuli magulu ga hetwe twanguikung'huna hali hemwe. Ila mvizele kota Undewa wa Nguluwi wa habehi!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjelani, zuwa lila muji awo wogazika ng'hatu kusinda kugazika kula kwa wanhu wa Sodoma.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa miji jilemile kulonga gehile kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matei 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Kochona Kolasini! Kochona Betisaida! Kwa vila wone vinduzanduza vikoleche kwa hemwe navikoleche Tilo na Sidoni, wanhu wa hala wahavalile mivalo ja migunila na kikala kuli mivu na kulonga gehile ga hewo kwa Mkulu Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ne ahyo kuli zuwa lya utaguso hemwe mopata magazo makulu kusinda Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Nagwe Kapanaumu, ndaze kokwinuligwa mbaka kilanga? Hebu, koduliswa mbaka kuli isi ya wabagame!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Hamba Yesu nakawalojela, “Munhu yoneche yalinguwahulichiza hemwe, kangunyhulichiza heni na yalingulema kuwabochela hemwe, kangundema heni. Na yalingulema kumbochela heni, kangulema kumbochela yula yandajize.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wala makumi saba na weli wanguhiluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Hamba wala makumi saba na weli nawahiluka wasangalale, nawalonga, “Mkulu mbaka vijeni navituhulika kwa itagwa lya hegwe.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Nandilyona limazoga lyangulagala kulawa kilanga kota lumwemwesa lya limlungu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Lole nandiwapa ludali lwa kubiga mizoka na nyinje na ludali hali mong'ho weng'ha lwa yula mng'honyo, kuduhuli choneche chiwalumiza. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Lelo mleche kusangalala kwa vila vijeni naviwahulichiza, ila msangalale kwa vila matagwa genu nagandichigwa kilanga.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusangalala kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matei 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mhela wuwula, Yesu nakatowa luchenze kwa Muhe Yelile yolonga, “Ndangumtogola, Mhaza, Mkulu wa kilanga na kuli isi, kwa vila nakuwavisa mbuli azi wawele na luhala na wasomile, nakuwagubulila wana wadodo. Ena, Mhaza, kwa vila ahyo ndo vyounojezwe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Hamba nakalonga, “Mhaza wa heni nakunipa vinhu vyeng'ha. Haduhuli yalingumzela Mwana ila Mhaza, ne yalingumzela Mhaza ila Mwana na yoneche yula yawele Mwana kogana kumgubulila.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Hamba Yesu nakawahinduchila walanguswa wa heye na kulonga nawo chinyele, “Fola wanhu wala walinguvyona vinhu vyomlinguvyona hemwe! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Kwa vila ndangukulonjelani, waloli wenji na wandewa nawagana kugona aga gomlingugona hemwe ila hawagawene, nawagana kuhulika gala gomlinguhulika hemwe ila hawagahuliche.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana na Msamalia yanojile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Mhela awo munhu yumwe yalingugazela ng'hatu malajizo ga Musa nakoya kwa Yesu leka yamjeze, nakamuuza, “Mlangusa, ndite choni leka ndiuhalile ukomu wa mazuwa gose?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Nakwandichigwa choni kuli chitabu cha malajizo ga Musa? Hegwe nakilangusa ndaze?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Nakamwidichila, “Mgane Mkulu Nguluwi kwa nhumbula ya hegwe yeng'ha na kwa muhe wa hegwe weng'ha na kwa mong'ho wa hegwe weng'ha na kwa luhala lwako lweng'ha, na umgane yomlingikala habehi kota vyoulingigana gwegwe baho.” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Nakwidichila goya, udite ahyo nagwe kochikala.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ila munhu yula nakagana kilajila kota nakanoga, aho nakamuuza Yesu, “Yawele habehi na heni ndo whaani?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Munhu yumwe nayali yaduliche kulawa Yelusalemu kuluta Yeliko. Loyawele mnzila, nakavabigwa na wabokaji, nawamsukula vyeng'ha vyoyawele navyo na kumtowa, nawamleka yawasile bahala yawele behi kubagama. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Mtambika yumwe nakakola kuli nzila yila loyamuwene munhu yula yatowigwe, nakakola hafungo. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Hihyo Mlawi yumwe loyafichile hala nakamona munhu yatowigwe, naye nakakola hafungo. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ila Msamalia yumwe yawele mmajendo nakafika hala hoyawele yula munhu yatowigwe, loyamuwene, kamonela isungu. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Nakamhejelela habehi, nakavibakaliza mafuta na Divai vilonda na kuviwopa. Hamba nakamkwiniza mchanya mwa idogowi lyake, nakamigala mbaka kuli ng'handa ya wajenzi na kumlolela. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Mitondo Msamaliya yula nakalavya sendi denali mbili nakamha yawele na ng'handa ya wajenzi na kumlonjela, ‘Mlolele ayu munhu, choneche choyotumiya mzidi ndokupa hondihiluka.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Hamba Yesu nakamuuza munhu yula, “Hali awo wanhu wadatu, yalikohi yalajile kota kangikalasa habehi na yula munhu yatowigwe na wabokaji?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yula munhu yalingugazela ng'hatu Malajizo ga Musa nakedichila, “Yula yamonele isungu.” Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ulute nagwe ukadite hiho.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hakaye ha Malita na Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Lowawele mmajendo Yesu na walanguswa wa heye nawenjila kuli chijiji chimwe na mdala yumwe yalinguchemigwa Malita nakambochela hakaye hake. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Malita nayali na mdodowe yalinguchemigwa Maliya, ayu nakekalisa habehi na Yesu yohulichiza malanguso gake. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ila Malita nayali yodita mbuli ziyage nyinji, lelo nakamlutila Yesu na kumlonjela, “Mkulu, hauligijesa kota lumbulyangu vyoyandechele mijito jeng'ha ndiliyeng'ha? Lelo mlonjele yoye yanhanze!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ila Mkulu nakamwidichila, “Malita, Malita! Lekachoni kwangusumajila na kugaya na vinhu vinji? <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ila changuganigwa chinhu chimwe hano. Maliya nakahagula chinhu chinojile ne haduhu munhu yomsukula.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalangusa walanguswa wa heye kulanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matei 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Zuwa limwe Yesu nayali honhu hamwe yolanda. Loyasindile kulanda, mlanguswa wa heye yumwe nakamlonjela, “Mkulu, twangukulanda utulanguse kulanda kota Yohani Mbatiza vyoyawalanguse walanguswa wa heye.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Lomlanda, mlonje hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">“ ‘Mhaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">itagwa lya hegwe litogoligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">undewa wa hegwe uye.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Utugalile chilyo cha hetwe cha chila zuwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Ugalechele gehile ga hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">kota hila vyotulinguwalechela weng'ha watuditile gehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Uleche kutwinjiza kuli kujezigwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Ndo whaani hali hemwe yawele na goloko, nakaluta kwa heye nechilo na kumlonjela, ‘Goloko, ndangukulanda umhe heni mibumunda jidatu, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />kwa vila goloko wa heni nakoya kwa heni kulawa mmajendo, nani ndahela ne chilyo cha kumha heye.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Naye yawele mng'handa yahamwidichile, ‘Uleche kunhunya! Heni na wanangu mana tuwasa. Hambe nyhinuche kumha hegwe chinhu choneche chila.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ndanguwalonjelani, hanga ayo munhu hokwinuka na kumha ajo mibumunda kwa vila ndo goloko wa heye, ila kwa chiwalo cha kulutilila kulanda kokwinuka na kumha heye chasi choyalingugana.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Ahyo ndanguwalonjelani, mlande namwe mopegwa na mpale namwe mochona na mhodize, namwe mochumulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwa vila yoneche yalingulanda kangupewaga na chila yalingupala kanguchonaga na chila yalinguhodiza lwizi kanguchumulilwaga. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ndaze, hana yoneche hali hemwe yawele komha mwanage izoka hoyolanda somba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ama komha mwana nyinje hoyolanda ifinga? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Wone hemwe muwele wehile mwanguvizela kuwamha wana wa hemwe vinhu vinojile, ndikomya Mhaza wa hemwe yawele kilanga kodita mzidi ng'hatu, kowamha Muhe Yelile wala walingumlanda?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matei 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Malichi 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Zuwa limwe Yesu nayali yochilavya chijeni chimditile munhu yumwe yawe hambe yalonje. Acho chijeni lochilawile, yula munhu nakaluka kulonga, lung'hongola lwa wanhu nalububuwala. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ila wanhu wanji nawalonga, “Kangulavya vijeni kwa ludali lwa Belisebuli, mkulu wa vijeni.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Wanji nawamjeza Yesu, nawagana yawalajile ulajilo kulawa kilanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ila Yesu nakavizela chowalingijesa, nakawalonjela, “Undewa woneche ugawanuche kuli vilundo vilingitwanza, hambe uweze kulutilila, hihyo du na lukolo loneche lulingitwanza lodumigwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Wone Limazoga lyangitwanza liliyeka, undewa wake wokwima ndaze? Ndanguwalonjela, kwa vila mwangulonga kota ndangulavya vijeni kwa ludali lwa Belisebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Wone ndangulavya vijeni kwa ludali lwa Belisebuli, ndaze walinguwawinza, hewo walavyaga vijeni kwa ludali lwa whaani? Kwa chiwalo acho hewo ndo wowatagusa hemwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ila wone heni ndangulavya vijeni kwa ludali lwa Nguluwi, lelo mvizele kota Undewa wa Nguluwi nawuya kwa hemwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Munhu yawele na mong'ho hoyokwamila ng'handa ya heye kwa vinhu vya kitowela ngondo, vinhu vya heye vya kuli kikala goya. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ila wone yoye munhu yawele na mong'ho ng'hatu kusinda heye, komtowa na komsukula vinhu vya kitowela ngondo vyoyali ngitumbila na kuhola vinhu vya heye. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Yoneche yohambe yelumbe na heni, kangundema na yoneche yohambe yakungajize hamwe na heni, kangusambalula.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka kwa chijeni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matei 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Chijeni hochiwinjigwa kwa munhu, changubemhelaga honhu hagunuche, changupala honhu ha kwesela. Wone hachipatile changilonjelaga, ‘Ndohiluka kaye kwa heni.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Lochihiluka na kuifika nganda ifajiligwe na kunoligwa, <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />changulutaga kuvihola vijeni vinji saba vihile kusinda heye. Vyeng'ha vyangulutaga na kumwinjila ayo munhu. Ahyo munhu ayo kowa yogazigwa ng'hatu kusinda aho hamwande.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usangalalo wa kukomya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu loyawele yolonga ago, mdala yumwe hali lula lung'hongola nakalonga kwa lizi likulu, “Nakatambichizwa mdala yakupondile na kukonyeza!” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu nakedichila, “Nawatambichizwa wala walinguhulika na kuhulichiza ulonzi wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangugana kona ulajilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matei 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Wanhu lowalutilile konjezeka, Yesu nakalutilila kulonga, “Alu ndo lulelo lwihile. Lwangugana ulajilo, ila halupegwa ulajilo woneche ila wa Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Kota hila Yona vyoyawele ulajilo kwa wanhu wa Ninawi, ndo Mwana wa munhu vyoyowa ulajilo kwa wanhu wa lulelo alu. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mndewa wa chidala wa kusini kolawila mhela wa lulelo alu holutagusigwa, naye kolutagusa kota luna wihe. Kwa vila nayali mmajendo kulawa kutali, nakoya kuhulichiza ulonzi wa luhala wa Solomoni na hano hana mkulu kusinda Solomoni. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Wanhu wa Ninawi wolawila mhela wa kutagusigwa, nawo wolutagusa lulelo alu kota luna wihe. Kwa vila Wanhu wa Ninawi nawamgalamchila Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha kudamla kwa Yona, lelo hano hana mkulu kusinda Yona!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwa lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matei 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Haduhu munhu yalingubwina chenje na kuchigubika na chisaye, ila kanguchiwikaga honhu ha kuwichila chenje leka wanhu howokwinjila wone lumuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Iziho lya hegwe ndo chenje cha lukuli lwa hegwe. Wone iziho lya hegwe liwe likomu, lukuli lwa hegwe lweng'ha lowa na lumuli. Wone liziho lya hegwe liwe hambe lilole na lukuli lwa hegwe lweng'ha lowa kuli jiza. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Lelo wilolele, lumuli louwele mgati mwako luleche kuwa jiza. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Wone lukuli lwa hegwe lweng'ha nalumema lumuli ne honhu honeche, kuwa na jiza, lelo kowa lumuli kota hila chenje vyochikulangazila lumuli lwake.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalonga Mafalisayo na walangusa wa Malajizo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matei 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malichi 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu loyawele yolonga, Mfalisayo yumwe nakamlanda yalute haluga hake kulya chilyo, naye Yesu nakaluta, kekalisa kulya chilyo. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mfalisayo ayo nakabubuwala loyamuwene Yesu yolya chilyo ne kuhovuga moko. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Mkulu nakamlonjela, “Hemwe Mafalisayo mwanguhovuga chizombe na luhelo kwa kunze, ila mgati mwa nammema ubokaji na wihe. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mwawapoka hemwe! Hamlinguvizela kota yalumbile kunze ndo yalumbile mgati? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Mlavye kwa wazunwa vinhu vyomuwele navyo, Nguluwi kosangalala ng'hatu na chila chinhu chomdita chowelizwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Mochona hemwe Mafalisayo! Kwa vila mwangumha Nguluwi mwangulavya zaka za vinhu kota vila tangawizi na ibwasi na mboga ziyage zinji za mahamba, ila mwangubeza hachi na igano lya Nguluwi. Namganigwa kudita aga ga keli ne kubeza ago ga mwaluko.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Mochona hemwe Mafalisayo! Kwa vila hemwe mwangugana kikalisa kuli vigoda vya kumwando kuli masunagogi na kulamswa kwa kuhulichiza kuli honhu ha kugula na kuguzila vinhu. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Mochona hemwe kwa vila namiwanha kota vilaga vilihela ulajilo, viwele wanhu wanguvibiga ne kuvizela.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Yumwe wa walangusa wa Malajizo ga Musa nakamlonjela Yesu, “Mlangusa, vyoulonga ayo kwangutuliga.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Namwe walangusa wa Malajizo mochona! Kwa vila mwanguwadwika wanhu mhomolo ziwele na itunyo ikulu, kuno hemwe hambe mgolole ne chidole kuwatanza. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Mochona hemwe! Kwa vila mwanguzenga vilaga vya waloli wa Nguluwi wakopoligwe na wahaza wa hemwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Namwe mwangulavya ulolezi na kikundiza kwa chila chowaditile wasekulu wa hemwe, nawawakopola waloli, namwe mwanguzenga vilaga vya hewo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kwa chiwalo cha mbuli hino, luhala lwa Nguluwi lwangulonga hino, ‘Ndowegalila waloli na watumigwa, ila wamwe wowakopola na wanji kuwagaza.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ahyo lulelo alu lozapigwa kwa chiwalo cha danda ya waloli weng'ha ibohoche kulawila isi loilumbigwe, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />kulawa kukopoligwa kwa Abeli mbaka kukopoligwa kwa Sekaliya, yawele nawamkopola hali honhu ha kulavila nhambiko na honhu helile. Ena, ndikomya, lulelo alu lozapigwa kwa madito ago.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Mochona hemwe walangusa wa malajizo! Kwa vila namvisa chichumulilo cha lwizi lwa ng'handa ya luhala, Hemwe hamwinjile na namuwalemeza walingugana kwinjila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu loyawele yokuka hala, wala Mafalisayo na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa nawaluka kitwanza na heye na kumuuza mbuli nyinji, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />leka wamgwilize kwa ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo kuwala udesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matei 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mhela awo lung'hongola lwa wanhu maelufu loluwele hamwe mbaka nalwali luchibiga, Yesu nakaluka kulonga na walanguswa wa heye, nakawalonjela “Milolele na ulanguso wihile wa Mafalisayo ulinguwahada. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Chinhu choneche chigubikwe chogubuligwa na chila chivisigwe chozeleka. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ahyo gala gomlonjile kuli jiza, wanhu wogahulika hali lumuli na geng'ha gomlonjile kwa kupwepwa kuno mhindile lwizi, godamligwa mchanya mwa ng'handa.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yalinguganigwa kudumbigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matei 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ndangukulonjelani goloko wa heni, mleche kuwadumba walingukopola lukuli, wohambe waweze kudita chinhu chiyage mzidi. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Ila ndowalonjelani whaani wa kumdumba. Mumdumbe yula hoyosinda kukopola kana ludali lwa kumtaga kuli chiluli cha mazuwa gose. Ena, mumdumbe ayo.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Mwanguvizela kota semembe wahano wanguguzigwa kwa migwala mili ja sendi? Ila hali Nguluwi hambe chisemigwe ne chimwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ena, mbaka mnvili za kumutwi kwa hemwe naziwazigwa zeng'ha. Ahyo mleche kudumba, kwa vila namganigwa ng'atu kusinda videje avyo!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumkunda na kumlema Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matei 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Ndangukulonjelani, munhu yoneche yalikung'hunda hali wanhu, naye Mwana wa munhu komkunda hali wahilisi wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ila munhu yoneche hoyondema hali wanhu, naye Mwana wa munhu komlema hali wahilisi wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Munhu yoneche hoyolonga ulonzi wihile hali Mwana wa munhu kolechelwa, ila munhu yoneche hoyomkovula Muhe Yelile holechelwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Howowegala kuli masunagogi na hali wakulu na vilongozi, mleche kuwa na lunhwinhwi kuwala vila vyomchilewela ama vyomlonga. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwa vila Muhe Yelile kowalangusani mhela wuwo chomlinguganigwa kulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana na yawele na lufufu mpoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Munhu yumwe kuli lung'hongola lwa wanhu nakamlonjela Yesu, “Mlangusa, mlonjele mng'holozangu tigawile uhalizi wa hetwe wotulechelwe na mhaza wa hetwe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Goloko, whaani yambichile ndiwe hali hemwe?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela weng'ha, “Milolele na ubuhu, kwa vila ukomu wa munhu hauwele kuli winji wa lufufu loyawele nalo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela nhelo ayi, “Mgunda wa yawele na lufufu naulela lukami. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ayo munhu nakejesa mnhumbula ya heye, ‘Ndite choni? Ndahela honhu ha kuhega ha kuwika mbena za heni.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Hamba nakelonjela, ‘Ndodita ahi, ndobomola ng'hano za heni na kuzenga zinji ziwele ng'hulu ng'hatu, ndowika amo mbena na vinhu vya heni vyeng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Hamba ndoilonjela nhumbula ya heni, lelo kuna vinhu vinji vinojile vyouwichile ng'hano kwa miyaka minji. Ahyo wesele, ulye, unwe na usangalale!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ila Nguluwi nakamlojela, ‘Mpoka hegwe! Lehano nechilo nhumbula ya hegwe yoholigwa. Lelo avyo vinhu vyouwichile ng'hano kwa chiwalo cha hegwe vyowa vya whaani?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu nakasinda kwa kulonga, “Ahyo ndo vyoiwa kwa walingiwichila lufufu ila hambe wewiche goya kwa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Witumbile Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matei 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Ahyo ndangukulonjelani, mleche kitunya kwa chiwalo cha ukomu wa hemwe kota molya choni ama lukuli kota movala choni. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwa vila ukomu ndo mzidi wa chilyo na lukuli ndo mzidi wa nguwo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mijese kuwala videje, hambe vinyale ne kubeta, vyahela ng'hano ne honeche ha kuwika nyhule, ila Nguluwi kanguvidita vilye. Hemwe ndo mnoga ng'hatu kusinda avyo videje! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ndo whaani hali hemwe yawele kwa kitunya kwa heye kanguweza konjezela lisaa limwe kuli kikala kwa heye? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Wone kwangulemwela kudita mbuli ndodo kota ayo, leka choni kitunya kwa chiwalo cha azo zinji? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Mlole uluwa vyoulingutitima. Hambe ukole mijito ne kubota. Ila ndangukulonjelani, Solomoni na lufufu lwake lweng'ha hanoligwe goya kota umwe wa uluwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Wone Nguluwi kangujinoliga misolo ja kumgunda jiwele lehano ja baha na mitondo jangutajigwa kuli chiluli. Ndaze, howanoliga goya ng'hatu mzidi? Hemwe wanhu muwele na makundo mado!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Lelo mleche kugaya kota molya choni na monwa choni na mleche kuwa na lunhwinhwi kuwala aga. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Kwa vila ago geng'ha ganguganigwa na wanhu wa isi wohawamzelele Nguluwi, Ila mhaza wa hemwe wa kilanga, kanguvizela kota mwangugagana aga geng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ahyo muupale Undewa wa Nguluwi na aga geng'ha mopegwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufufu lwa kilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matei 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Mleche kudumba hemwe chilundo chidodo, kwa vila Mhaza wa hemwe nakona yagoya kuwapa undewa. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Mguze vinhu vya hemwe, muwamhe wazunwa sendi azo. Migongomanyile mihako johambe jilale, miwichile ng'hano yohambe imale kilanga, honhu hawele mhizi hambe yahejelele ne fukuzi kuwifya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kwa vila hawele ng'hano ya hegwe hoyili, ndo nhumbula ya hegwe hoyiwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Miwiche goya kwa kiwoha isali mchuno na vyenje vya hemwe viwe vikwaka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />muwe kota vitumagwa walingumbeteza mkulu wa hewo yahiluche kulawa kuli mnvina ya kuhesa, leka hoyokuya na kuhodiza kuli lwizi waweze kuchumula lwizi baho du kwa chiwalo cha heye. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Nawatambichizwa vitumagwa wawele mkulu wa hewo hoyokuya kowafika wa meho wangubeteza. Ndikomya ndanguwalonjelani, kochiwoha isali lya heye na kuwalonjela wekale leka walye, naye kokuya kuwakolela mijito. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Wotambichizwa vitumagwa awo wone mkulu wa hewo hoyokuya na kuwafika wawele meho, hanga kokuya nechilo ng'hatu ama habehi na kubwemwenzuka. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ila mvizele mbuli ayi, wone yawele na ng'handa nayavizele mhela hoyokuya mhizi, nayekale meho na kulolela ng'handa ya heye ileche kubenigwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Namwe mwanguganigwa miwiche goya, kwa vila Mwana wa munhu kokuya mhela wohamuuzelele.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitumagwa wa kitumbila na yula yawele mdesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matei 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petili nakamuuza, “Mkulu, nhelo ayi kwangutulonjela hetwe yeka ama wanhu weng'ha?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Ndo whaani yawele chitumagwa wa kitumbila na yawele na luhala, yawele mkulu wa heye komuwika mchanya mwa vitumagwa wanji leka yawape wanhu chilyo kwa mhela ulinguganigwa? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kotambichizwa yula chitumagwa yawele mkulu wa heye hoyohiluka komfika yodita ahyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjelani, komuwika chitumagwa ayo yawe yololela lufufu lwake lweng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ila ayo chitumagwa wone yazengulonga mnhumbula ya heye, ‘Mkulu wa heni hambe yahiluche hima.’ Hamba nakaluka kuwatowa vitumagwa wayage, walume na wadala na kwaluka kulya na kunwa mbaka kugala, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />mkulu wa heye kohiluka kuli zuwa lyohajesile na kuli saa yohaizelele. Komzapa chitumagwa ayo na kumuwika hamwe na wala walihela makundo.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Chitumagwa yalinguvizela choyalingugana mkulu wa heye ila hambe yawiche goya ne kudita kota vyoyalingugana mkulu wa heye, chitumagwa ayo kotowigwa lukami. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ila yula yalingudita ne kuvizela gala galingulapa kutowigwa, kotowigwa hado. Yoneche yapeligwe vinhu vinji, kodayigwa vinhu vinji na yoneche yapeligwe vinhu vinji ng'hatu, kodayigwa vinhu vinji ng'hatu.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo chiwalo cha kilewa kwa wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matei 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Nambuya kigala chiluli kuli isi yeng'ha, wone nachiwele nachibwinigwa! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ila ndanawo ubatizo uwele ndanguganigwa kuubochela, ndaze vyondilingugaya mbaka wenele! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mwangijesa kota nambuya kigala kikala goya kuli isi? Hebu! Ndanguwalonjela haiwele ahyo, nambuya kigala kilewa. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kwaluchila sambi, kowa na wanhu wahano kuli ng'handa imwe, wadatu kwa weli na weli kwa wadatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Kowa na kilewa hali mhaza na wasongolo wa heye na msongolo na mhaza wa heye. Mamo na wahinza wa heye na mhinza na mamo wa heye. Mamo wa mlume na mkweye na mche na mamo wa mlume wa heye.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvizela mhela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matei 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu nakalulonjela kahi lung'hongola lwa wanhu, “Lomuyona ng'hungugu yangulawila kolizinjilaga isanya, baho du mwangulongaga, ‘Nhonya yotowa,’ Nayo yangutowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Lomkona mbeho ya kusini yanguputa, mwangulongaga, ‘Kowa na ivuche,’ Na yanguwa hiho. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Hemwe wahadi! Mwanguvizela kulavya uloli kwa kulola isi na ulanga, lekachoni mwangulemwela kuvizela mana ya mihela aji?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kihanyisa na mng'honyo wa hegwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matei 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Lekachoni mwangulemwela kwamula mbuli inojile ya kudita? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Wone mlonjelezi wa hegwe yakugale kuli chitala, yahawele goya kwa hegwe kihanyisa naye lomuwa mnzila, leka yaleche kukugala hali mtagusa, naye mtagusa kokulavya kwa wamizi, nawo wokwinjiza mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ndangukulonjela, haulawa ako kuchinweng'ho mbaka housinda kulavya sendi ya mwiso zeng'ha.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Mleche gehile ama mobagama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mhela wuwo, wanhu wamwe nawamlonjela Yesu mbuli za wanhu wa Galilaya wawele Pilato nayali yawakopole na danda ya awo wanhu nakahanzanya na nhambiko yowawele woilavya. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu nakawauza, “Mwangijesa kota Wagalilaya awo wawele nawabagama nawali na gehile ng'hatu kusinda Wagalilaya wanji weng'ha? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Hebu! Ndanguwalonjelani, wone namwe hamlonjile gehile ga hemwe kwa Nguluwi, modumigwa kota hewo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ama wala wanhu kumi na nane wabagame kwa kugwilwa na ilingo ako Siloamu, mwangijesa kota hewo nawali wehile kusinda wanhu weng'ha wawele nawali wochikala Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Hebu! Ndanguwalonjelani, wone namwe hamlonjile gehile ga hemwe kwa Nguluwi, weng'ha modumigwa kota hewo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana na igodi lya mafuza lyohambe lilele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela nhelo ayi, “Munhu yumwe nayali na igodi lya mtini kuli mgunda wa heye wa zabibu. Munhu ayo nakaluta kubawa tini kuli igodi alyo, ila hapatile ne imwe. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ahyo nakamlonjela yalingulolela mgunda, ‘Lole! Kwa mhela wa miyaka jidatu nandali ndikuya kubawa mafuza ga igodi ali ne kupata choneche. Uliteme igodi ali! Lekachoni lilutilile kuwifya misanga hela?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ila ayo yalingulolela mgunda nakedichila, ‘Mkulu, tulileche kwa mwaka umwe, nani ndouhalila na kuuwichila mboto. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Wone lyolela kuli mwaka ulinguya, goya! Ila wone halilelile, kolitema.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumusila utamwa mdala kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Zuwa lya Kwesela, Yesu nayali yolangusa kuli sunagogi. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mhela wuwo nakoya mdala yumwe yawele na chijeni, chijeni acho nachimdita mdala ayo yawe na chiduhi kwa mhela wa miyaka kumi na nane na nayali yolemwela kwima kwa kugoloka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu loyamuwene, nakamchema, nakamlonjela, “Mdala, nakusilwa utamwa wouwele nawo.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Yesu nakamuwichila moko yula mdala, baho du yula mdala nakema kwa kugoloka, nakaluka kumtogola Nguluwi.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ila chilongozi wa sunagogi nakazudila kwa vila Yesu nakamusila munhu utamwa kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela. Ahyo nakalulonjela lula lung'hongola lwa wanhu, “Hana mazuwa sita gawele wanhu wanguganigwa kukola mijito. Kuli mazuwa ago, muye musilwe matamwa genu, ila haiwele kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ila Mkulu nakamwidichila, “Hemwe wahadi! Whaani hali hemwe hambe yalichumulile isenga lya heye ama idogowi lya heye kulawa kuli ibani na kulihilika kunwa mazi kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Lelo hano kabaha mhinza wa Abulahamu, yawele Limazoga nalimdita yawe chete kwa miyaka kumi na nane. Lelo haganigwe kuloholigwa kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Loyasindile kulonga ago, wala walingitwanza na heye nawona soni, ila wanhu wanji nawasangalala kwa vinduzanduza vyoyaditile.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwhana kwa nyhadikwa ndodo ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matei 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Malichi 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Hamba Yesu nakauza, “Undewa wa Nguluwi wangiwhana na choni? Ndouwhaniza na choni? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Nauwhana na nyhadikwa ya haladali, iwele munhu nakaihola na kuinyala kuli mgunda wa heye. Nyhadikwa ayo nayota, hamba naliwa igodi ikulu mbaka videje vya kilanga navizenga vimvulila vyawo kuli nhagala zake.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiwahana na nungo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matei 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu nakauza kahi, “Ndouwhaniza na choni Undewa wa Nguluwi? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Wangiwhana na nungo iwele mdala nakaihola na kuhanzanya na utimbo vidoto vidatu, hamba utimbo weng'ha naufuluma.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwizi luzisili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matei 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu nakalutilila na majendo kuluta Yelusalemu. Loyawele mzila, nakakola kuli miji na vijiji kuno yowalangusa wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Munhu yumwe nakamuuza, “Mkulu, ndo wanhu wachefu hela wawele woloholigwa?” <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Mikangaze ng'hatu kwinjila kwa kukolela kuli lwizi luzisili, kwa vila ndangukulonjelani kota wanhu wenji wojeza kwinjila, ila wolemwela. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Mhela yawele na ng'handa hoyokwinuka na kuhinda lwizi, mokwima kunze kuno muhodiza lwizi na kulonga, ‘Mkulu, tuchumulile lwizi.’ Ila heye kowedichila, ‘Siwazelele ne komlawile.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Aho ndo mwokwidichila, ‘Natulya na kunwa hamwe na hegwe, kahi nakutulangusa kuli vijiji vya hetwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ila heye kowedichila, ‘Siwazelele hemwe ne komlawa. Muche hali heni, hemwe wadita gehile!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Aho ndo molila na kujejeda mizino, homuwona Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakubu na waloli weng'ha wawele hali Undewa wa Nguluwi, ila hemwe namtozigwa kunze! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Wanhu wokuya kulawa kolilawilaga isanya na kolizinjilaga isanya na kasikazini na kusini, nawo wochikala kuli mvina ya Undewa wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Ena, wala wawele kuli kuduma wowa wa mwaluko, na wala wawele wa mwaluko wowa kuli kuduma.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguililila Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matei 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mhela wuwo wamwe wa Mafalisayo nawamlutila Yesu, nawamlonjela, “Uche hano ulute honhu hanji, kwa vila Helodi kangugana kukukopola.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Mlute mkalilonjele ahi alyo likanhu, ‘Lehano na mitondo ndanguviwinga vijeni na kuwosela wanhu matamwa, haucha ndosinda mijito ja heni.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ahyo lehano na mitondo na haucha, ndanguganigwa ndutilile na majendo, kwa vila haiwele goya mloli wa Nguluwi yakopoligwe hanze ha Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yelusalemu! Gwa Yelusalemu! Kwanguwakopola waloli na kuwatowa kwa maganga wala walajizwe kwa hegwe. Lwa kalinga nanjeza kuwakungajiza wana wa hegwe kwa heni kota vila ng'huku vyoilingukungajiza vinziya vya heye hasi ha mabawa gake, ila hegwe huganile! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Ulole, ng'handa ya hemwe nailechigwa uchiwa. Ndanguwalonjelani hammbona kahi mbaka mhela wula homlonga, ‘Yatambichizwe ayo yalinguya kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumusila utamwa munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Zuwa limwe lya kwesela, Yesu nakaluta kulya chilyo kaye kwa mkulu yumwe wa Mafalisayo. Wanhu wawele aho nawali womlolela ng'hatu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Kumwando kwa Yesu nakwali na munhu yumwe yawele na safula nakamlutila. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu nakawauza walangusa wa Malajizo na Mafalisayo, “Ndaze, yagoya kulohola kuli zuwa lya kwesela ama hebu?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ila hewo nawenyamalila. Yesu nakamibata ayo mtamwa, nakamusila utamwa, nakamlonjela yalute. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Hamba kawalonjela, “Whaani hali hemwe mwanage ama isenga lya heye wone linjile kuli izimbo kuli Zuwa lya Kwesela holikwega kulilavya?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Nawo nawalemwela kwidichila.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uliholile na kunyenyetela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu loyawawene wala walalikwe vyowali wohagula honhu ha lutogo ha kikala, nakawalonjela weng'ha nhelo ayi, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Wone munhu yakulaliche kuli mnvina ya kuhesa, uleche kikalisa honhu ha lutogo, yoweza kuwa hana munhu yunji yalalikwe yawele kana lutogo ng'hatu kusinda hegwe, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />na yawalaliche hemwe kokuya na kukulonjela, ‘Mlechele ayu honhu aha.’ Baho kodeula hali weng'ha na kuluta kikala kumbele ngatu. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ila houlalikwa kuli mnvina, wikale honhu ha kumbele, leka yula yakulaliche hoyokuyila yakulonjele, ‘Goloko, winuche uye wikale kuno kumwando, honhu hanojile ng'hatu.’ Aho kowa utogoligwe hali wanhu weng'ha wekalise hamwe na hegwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kwa vila munhu yoneche yalingikwiniza, koduliswa na yoneche yalingidulisa, kokwinizwa.” <verse eid="LUK 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Hamba Yesu nakamlonjela yula yamlaliche, “Wone kowalalika wanhu kulya chilyo cha nemisi ama cha nechilo, uleche kuwalalika goloko wa hegwe ama wang'holozo ama womlingikalasa habehi wawele na lufufu. Kwa vila wone udite ahyo, hewo nawo wokulalika hakaye hawo na wowa wakuhilulile chila chouwaditile. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ila loudita mnvina, walaliche wazunwa na ng'hochele na vyete na wohambe walole <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />nagwe kotambichizwa na Nguluwi. Kwa vila awo wahela chinhu cha kukuhilusila. Nguluwi kokuhilusila kuli mhela wa kuzilipuligwa uwele na hachi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvina ng'hulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matei 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Yumwe wa wala wanhu wekalise hamwe na Yesu kuli chisaga loyahuliche ago, nakamlonjela, “Nakatambichizwa munhu yula yozangulya chilyo kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Munhu yumwe nakawika goya mnvina ng'hulu nakawalalika wanhu wenji. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Mhela wa kulya loufichile, nakamlonjela chitumagwa wa heye yawalonjele wala walalikwe, ‘Muye, chila chinhu cha goya.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ila weng'ha nawalema, chila munhu nayali yolonga kana mbuli ya kukola. Munhu wa mwaluko nakamlonjela yula chitumagwa, ‘Nangula mgunda, ahyo ndangugana ndute ndikaulole. Dedede, ndangulanda ung'hundize.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Munhu yunji nakalonga, ‘Nangula misenga kumi ja kulimila, lelo ndamnzila ndanguluta kujijeza, Dedede, ndangulanda ung'hundize.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Yunji nakalonga, ‘Nanyhesa, ahyo ndolemwela kuya.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Yula chitumagwa nakahiluka na kumlonjela mkulu wa heye mbuli ayo. Ayo yawele na ng'handa loyahuliche ago nakazudila, nakamlonjela yula chitumagwa, ‘Ulute himahima nzila ng'hulu na nzila ndodo za miji, uwegale wanhu wawele wazunwa na vyete na wohambe walole na ng'hochele.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Yula chitumagwa nakamlonjela, ‘Mkulu, gala goundajize nandigakolela mijito kota vyoundajize, ila hang'hali hana honhu hasigale.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Yula mkulu nakamlonjela chitumagwa wa heye, ‘Ulute kuli nzila ng'hulu na nzila ndodo hanze ha muji na uwegale wanhu kwa lupichi leka ng'handa ya heni imeme. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kwa vila ndangukulonjelani, haduhu ne yumwe kuli wala walalikwe yojeza chilyo kuli mnvina ya heni.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vyoulinguganigwa kuwa mlanguswa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matei 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lung'hongola wa wanhu nalwali kuli majendo hamwe na Yesu, naye nakawagalamchila, nakawalonjela, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Munhu yoneche hoyokuya kwa heni howa mlanguswa wa heni wone hanganile ng'hatu heni kusinda mhaza wa heye na mamo wa heye na mdala wa heye na wanage na wang'holoze na walumbuze, ena mbaka kikala kwa heye yuye. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Munhu yoneche yohambe yahole msalaba wa heye na kumbinza hambe yaweze kuwa mlanguswa wa heni.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Whaani hali hemwe wone yagane kuzenga ng'handa hambe yekalise leka yejese kota kana sendi za kuhega za kweneza kuzenga? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Leka yaleche kulemwela kuzenga hala du hoyosinda kubawa msisi, weng'ha walingulolela wokwaluka kumbeza heye, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />wolonga, ‘Munhu ayu nakaluka kuzenga, ila nakalemwela kusinda kuzenga!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Ama ndo mndewa wachi yalingulawa na kuluta kitowa na mndewa yunji ne kijesa wone kowa na wamizi elufu kumi (10,000) koweza kitowa na yula yalinguya na wamizi elufu makumi meli (20,000)? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Wone kangona kolemwela, kowalajiza wasenga wamdedeze yula mndewa yang'hali kutali leka waleche kitowa, wekale goya. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Hihyo du, yoneche hali hemwe yawele kangulemwela kuleka vyeng'ha vyoyawelenavyo, howeza kuwa mlanguswa wa heni.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwino wohaunonile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matei 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Malichi 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Mwino ndo chinhu chinonile, ila wone uwe haunonile, wonojezwa na choni mbaka uwe unonile kahi? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Hambe itanze chinhu kuli misanga ne kuli mboto, wanhu woutaga kutali. Yawele na makutu yahuliche!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Iwhano lya ing'holo lyajilile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matei 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Zuwa limwe wakongoza kodi na wanhu wenji walingudita gehile nawaluta kumuhulichiza Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mafalisayo na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa nawang'ung'uta wolonga, “Mumlole munhu ayu! Kanguwabochela wawele ngudita gehile kahi kangulya nawo!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yesu nakawedichila kwa nhelo ayi. <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Wone yumwe wa hemwe kana ming'holo miya imwe, hoyovizela kota limwe hali ajo ming'holo nalyajilila, kodita choni? Kojileka jila makumi tisa na tisa kuli chiwala na kuluta kulipala lila lyajilile mbaka yalyone. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Hoyolipata kosangalala na kolipika mmayega ga heye. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Hoyofika kaye kowachema goloko wa heye na walingikalasa habehi na kuwalonjela, ‘Msangalale hamwe na heni kwa vila nandilyona ling'holo lya heni nalyajilile.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ndangukulonjelani, kowa na kusangalala ng'hatu kilanga kwa chwalo cha yalingudita gehile yumwe kumgalamchila Nguluwi kusinda wanhu watanganiche makumi tisa na tisa wohambe waganigwe kusilwa gehile.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhelo ya igwala lyajilile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Ama ndo mdala whachi yawele na migwala kumi, wone yajilize limwe hambe yabwine chenje ne kufajila ng'handa na kupala ng'hatu mbaka yayone? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Hoyolipata, kanguwachemaga goloko wa heye na walingikalasa habehi na heye na kuwalonjela, ‘Msangalale hamwe na heni kwa vila ndilyona igwala lya heni lyajilile.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Hihyo du ndangukulonjela, hana usangalalo hali wahilisi wa Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha yawele na gehile yumwe yalingulonga gehile ga heye kwa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwhano lya mwana yajilile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu nakalutilila kulonga, “Nakwali na munhu yumwe yawele na wana weli wasongolo. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Yula mdodo nakamlonjela mhaza wa heye, ‘Mhaza, umhe heni uhalizi wa heni.’ Ahyo mhaza nakawagawila lufufu lwa heye. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Logakolile mazuwa mado, yula mdodo nakaguza uhalizi wa heye, hamba nakoka na kuluta isi ya kutali, ako nakatumiya vibi sendi za heye. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Loyasindile kutumiya chila chinhu choyawelenacho, nalulawila lufemba kuli isi yila, naye nakaluka kugaya. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ahyo nakaluta kukola mijito kwa munhu yumwe nayali mwenyeng'haye wa isi yila, naye nakamhilika kuli mgunda wa heye yawe yohombela migubi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Nakawa na maya ga kulya mibanzi jojidile migubi, nakwali haduhu munhu yampele chilyo. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Nyhala lozaluche kuhiluka, nakelonjela, ‘Kula kuluga kwa mhaza wa heni kuna wakola mijito wenji wawele ngulya na kulechelela, iwa ndaze heni hano ndagubagama kwa nzala? <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ndokuka na kuluta kwa mhaza wa heni na kumlonjela kota, mhaza, nandita gehile hali Nguluwi na hali hegwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Hambe nganigwe kuchemigwa mwana wa hegwe, undite kota yumwe wa vitumagwa wa hegwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ahyo nakoka, nakaluta kwa mhaza wa heye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Ila loyawele yang'hali kutali, mhaza wa heye nakamona, nhumbula ya heye naimema isungu. Nakambilimila mwanage, nakamkumbatila na kumnonela. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Yula mwana nakamlonjela, ‘Mhaza, nambifya kwa Mkulu Nguluwi na kwa hegwe. Hambe nganigwe kuchemigwa mwana wa hegwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ila mhaza wa heye nakawalonjela vitumagwa, ‘Himahima! Migale nguwo inojile mumvalize. Mvicheni pete kuli chidole cha heye na makwamba kuli magulu ga heye! <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Hamba mlidumule singo ilogota lihatile, tulye na tudite mnvina! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwa vila ayu mwana wa heni nayali yabagame ila lelo nakazilipuka, nakajilila ila lelo nakoneka’ Ahyo nawaluka kudita mnvina.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Mhela awo yula mwana mkulu nayali kumgunda. Loyawele yohiluka, habehi na kaye nakahulika lizi lya zimbo na wanhu wovina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Nakamchema chitumagwa yumwe na kumuuza, ‘Hana choni?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Yula chitumagwa nakamlonjela, ‘Mng'holozo nakahiluka haluga na mhaza wa hegwe nakalidumula singo ilogota lihatile kwa vila mwana wa heye nakahiluka yawele mkomu.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Ayo mwana mkulu nakazudila ng'hatu, nakalema kwinjila mng'handa. Mhaza wa heye nakalawa kunze na kumdedeza yenjile mng'handa. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ila heye nakamwidichila mhaza wa heye, ‘Wijese, miyaka jeng'ha nandikukolela mijito, ne zuwa limwe silechile kuhulichiza mzilo wa hegwe ne umwe. Nakumha choni? Humhele ne mhene ndodo leka sangalale na goloko wa heni! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ila ayu mwanago yawifile lufufu lwa hegwe na wang'hondwa loyahiluche kaye nakulidumula singo ilogota lihatile kwa chiwalo cha heye!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Mhaza wa heye nakamwidichila, ‘Mwana wa heni, nakuwa na heni kwa mazuwa gose, chila chinhu chombele nacho ndo cha hegwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ila naitugana tudite mnvina kwa vila ayu mng'holozo nayali yabagame, lelo kamkomu, nayali yajilile lelo nakoneka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mlolezi msugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Nakwali na munhu yumwe yawele na lufufu na yalingulolela lufufu lwa heye. Wanhu nawamlonjela kota ayo yalingulolela mijito ja hegwe kanguwifya lufufu. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Yula yawele na lufufu nakamchema, nakamlonjela, ‘Ndo mbuli zachi zondili nguhilika kuwala hegwe? Undajile hisabu ya chomhatile na chonhumiye kuli lufufu lwa heni, kwa vila hambe ulutilile kuwa mlolezi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Yula mlolezi nakejesa mnhumbula ya heye, Mkulu wa heni nakambusa kuli mijito ja heni, ndodita ndaze? Ndahela mong'ho wa kulima, ndangona soni kulanda kota wazunwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ena, ndanguvizela ndite choni, leka hala hondiwinjingwa kuli mijito ja heni, wanhu wanyheme haluga ha hewo. <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Hamba nakawachema weng'ha walingudayigwa na mkulu wa heye, nakamuuza wa mwaluko, ‘Kwangudayigwa chasi chachi na mkulu wa heni?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Heye nakedichila, ‘Madalamu miya nane ga mafuta ga mzeituni.’ Yula mlolezi nakamlonjela, ‘Uhole ayi kalatasi ilingulajila ndaze vyoulingudayigwa na wandiche miya zine.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Kahi nakamuuza munhu wa keli, ‘Hegwe kwangudayigwa chasi chachi?’ Heye nakedichila, ‘Ngano vipimilo elufu imwe.’ Yalingulolela nakedichila, ‘Uhole kalatasi ya hegwe ya ulajilo na wandiche miya nane.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Lelo yula mkulu nkamtogola ayo yalingulolela kwa vila vyoyaditile kwa luhala. Kwa vila wahu wa isi ayi ndo wajuvi ng'hatu howopala vinhu vya isi kusinda wanhu wa kuli lumuli.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu nakalutilila kulonga, “Mtumiye lufufu lwa kuli isi ayi kwa kipalila goloko leka holumala muchumulilwe kuli kikala kwa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Yoneche yalinguganigwa kuli mbuli ndodo, kahi ndo wa wakukundigwa kuli mbuli ng'hulu. Ila munhu halingukundigwa kuli mbuli ndodo, howeza kukundigwa kuli mbuli ng'hulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Wone hamuwele wa kukundigwa kuli lufufu lwa isi, ndo whaani kowapa lufufu lwa kukomya? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Wone hamuwele wa kukundigwa kuli lufufu lwa yunji, ndo whaani kowapa lufufu lwa hemwe?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Haduhu chitumagwa yalinguweza kuwakolela mijito wakulu weli, kwa vila komzudila yumwe na kumgana yunji, ama kochilumba na yumwe na kumbeza yunji. Hambe muweze kumfugamila Nguluwi na lufufu kwa mhela umwe.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi unji wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matei 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Malichi 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mafalisayo lowahuliche ago nawambeza Yesu kwa vila nawali wogana sendi lukami. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Aho nakawalojela, “Hemwe mwangilajila kota mna hachi hali wanhu, ila Nguluwi kanguzizela nhumbula za hemwe. Kwa vila vinhu viwele wanhu wanguvigana ng'hatu kwa Nguluwi ndo uzudizo.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Malajizo na gala gandichigwe na waloli navyali mbaka kuli mhela wa Yohani Mbatiza. Kulawila aho Mbuli Inojile ya Undewa wa Nguluwi yangudamligwa na chila munhu kangwinjila kwa mong'ho. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Ndo ubewe ng'hatu kwa ulanga na isi kukola kusinda helufi imwe ya malajizo kusigwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Munhu yoneche yalingumleka mchewake na kumhesa yunji kangudita ung'hondwa na yoneche yalingumhesa mdala yalechigwe na mlume wa heye kangudita ung'hondwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yawele na lufufu na Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Nakwali na munhu yumwe yawele na lufufu, yawele yovala mivalo ja sendi nyinji ng'hatu ja kitani inojile na kudita mnvina chila zuwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Kuli lwizi lwa ng'handa ya heye nakwali na munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Lasalo, yawele nayali yamemile vilonda mlukuli. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lasalo nakagana yalye usanyangwa ulagale kulawa kuli chisaga cha yula yawele na lufufu, mzidi wa ago mibwa najali jikuya na kumyanga vilonda vya heye!<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Lelo yula mzunwa nakabagama, nawo mwahilisi nawahola, nawamuwika habehi na Abulahamu na yula yawele na lufufu naye nakabagama, nakatiligwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Yula yawele na lufufu loyawele yogazigwa kula kuli isi ya wabagame, nakenula meho ga heye, nakamona Abulahamu kwa kutali na Lasalo yekale hafungo hake. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Lelo nakachema kwa lizi likulu, ‘Mhaza Abulahamu, mbonele isungu, mlonjele Lasalo yadolize chidole cha heye kuli mazi leka yahoze umyango wa heni kwa vila ndangugazika ng'hatu kuno kuli chiluli.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Abulahamu nakedichila, ‘Ukumbuchile kota kuli kikala kwa hegwe nakubochela, naye Lasalo nakabochela gehile. Lelo heye kanguhozwa nagwe kwangugazigwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Mzidi wa ago, hana ikulubila ikulu hali hetwe na hemwe, leka wala walingugana kuya kwa hemwe kulawa kwa hetwe walemwele na walingugana kuya kwa hetwe kulawa kwa hemwe walemwele.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Yawele na lufufu nakalonga, ‘Mhaza Abulahamu ndangukulanda umlajize Lasalo yalute kaye kwa mhaza wa heni. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Kwa vila ndina wang'holozangu wahano, yalute yawakanye leka waleche kuya kuno kuli magazo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Ila Abulahamu nakamlonjela, ‘Wang'holozo wanago Maandiko ga Musa na waloli, wawahulichize awo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ila heye nakalonga, ‘Hebu mhaza Abulahamu! Wone munhu kozilipuka kulawa kwa wabagame na kuwalutila, womgalamchila Nguluwi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abulahamu nakalonga, ‘Wone hambe wawahulichize Musa na waloli, hawojesa ne munhu hoyozilipuka kulawa kwa wabagame.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli zilingwambuza kudita gehile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matei 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Malichi 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Mbuli zilinguwambuza wanhu kudita gehile zolawila, ila kochona munhu yula yalinguzambuza. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Fola yawohigwe iganga likulu lya kubalasila kuli singo ya heye na kutozigwa kuli bahali kusinda kumwambuza yumwe wa wadodo wano kudita gehile. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Milolele! Wone mng'holozo yakuditile gehile, umkanye na hoyokunda kukanyigwa, mihanyise. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Wone yakuditile gehile mala saba kuli zuwa limwe na hoyohiluka kwa hegwe chila mhela kuli zuwa lilyo yolonga, ‘Ndangulanda tihanyise,’ yangukugana ukunde, mihanyise.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Walanguswa wa heye nawamlonjela, “Mkulu tonjezele makundo.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Naye mkulu nakawedichila, “Wone makundo ga hemwe nagawe mado kota nyhule ndodo ya haladali, mwahawezile kulilonjela ali igodi lya ikuyu, ‘Ung'humbuche ukote kuli bahali,’ nalyo naliwahulichize.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mijito ja chitumagwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Wone yumwe wa hemwe kana chitumagwa yalingukola mijto kulima ama kudima ming'holo, ndaze hoyohiluka kulawa kumgunda, komlonjela ayo chitumagwa himahima uye ulye chilyo? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ndaze! Hambe umlonjele, ‘Mbichile goya chilyo, wiwiche goya kung'holela mijito mbaka londisinda kulya na kunwa, ndo nagwe ulye kunwa’? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ndaze, ayo munhu kolonga malumbo kwa chitumagwa ayo kwa kweneza gala goyalonjelwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Hihyo du namwe homsinda kudita geng'ha gomlonjelwe, mlonje, ‘Hetwe ndo vitumagwa wa hihi hela, natudita gala gotulinguganigwa kudita.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguweliza wawele na uswema kumi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu loyawele kuli majendo kuluta Yelusalemu nakakola kuli mbaka ja Samaliya na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Loyawele yokwinjila kuli chijiji chimwe, naketing'hana na wanhu kumi wawele na uswema, wemile kutali. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Nawachemeleza kwa lizi likulu wolonga, “Yesu mlangusa tonele isungu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Loyawawene nakawalonjela, “Mlute mkelajile kwa watambika.” Nawo lowawele mzila woluta, nawelizwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yumwe wa hewo loyonile nakoselwa utamwa, nakahiluka kuno yomtogola Nguluwi kwa lizi likulu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Naketoza hasi hali magulu ga Yesu kuno yolonga malumbo. Ayo nayali Msamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Aho Yesu nakalonga, “Ndaze, hawawele wanhu kumi welizwe? Wala tisa wakohi? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Haduhuli yunji yahiluche kumtogola Nguluwi ila ayu mjenzi?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Hamba nakamlonjela yula munhu, “Winuche, ulute, makundo gako nagakulohola.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kwa Undewa wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matei 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Mhela umwe Mafalisayo nawamuuza Yesu, “Undewa wa Nguluwi wokuya nili?” Naye nakawedichila, “Undewa wa Nguluwi haukuya ukoneka. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Ne haduhu munhu yolonga, ‘Wahano,’ ama ‘Wahala.’ Ahyo Undewa wa Nguluwi wa mgati mwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Hamba kawalonjela walanguswa wa heye, “Mazuwa ganguya gawele mogana kulyona zuwa limwe lya Mwana wa munhu, ila hamlyona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Wanhu wowalonjelani, ‘Mlole ka hala!’ Ama ‘Mlole ka hano!’ Ila hemwe mleche kulawa ne kuwawinza. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kwa vila, kota lumwemwesa lwa limlungu vyolulingumwemwesa kuli ulanga kwaluchila ubanzi umwe mbaka uyage, ndo vyoiwa kwa Mwana wa munhu kuli zuwa lya heye. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ila kung'hali kukoleka ago, koganigwa kugazika ng'hatu na kulemigwa na lulelo alu. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Kota vyoiwele kuli mhela wa Nuhu, ndo vyoiwa kuli mazuwa ga Mwana wa munhu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Wanhu nawalutilila kulya na kunwa, kuhesa na kuhesigwa mbaka mhela wula Nuhu loyenjile kuli itumbwi. Mazi tendema nagalawila na kuwadumya weng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Yowa kota vyoilawile kuli mhela wa Lutu. Wanhu nawalutilila kulya na kunwa, kugula na kuguza, kunyala nyhadikwa na kuzenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ila zuwa lila Lutu loyochile Sodoma, maganga ga chiluli nagalagala kota nhonya kulawa kilanga na kuwadumya weng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ndo vyoiwa kuli zuwa alyo lya Mwana wa munhu hoyolawila.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Zuwa alyo, munhu yoneche yawele mchanya mwa chinduwiko cha ng'handa ya heye, yaleche kudulika kuhola vinhu vya heye viwele mng'handa. Hihyo du, yawele kumgunda yaleche kuhiluka kaye kuhola choneche. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mkumbuchile gala gamlawile mche wa Lutu. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Yoneche yalingugana kuilohola nhumbula ya heye koyajiliza na yoneche yalinguyajiliza koilohola. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ndangukulonjelani, zuwa alyo wanhu weli wowa wawasile hamwe kuli chinhanda chimwe, yumwe hali hewo koholigwa na yunji kolechigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Wadala weli wowa wobalasa nhyule hamwe, yumwe koholigwa na yunji kolechigwa.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Wanhu weli wowa kumgunda, yumwe koholigwa na yunji kolechigwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Hamba nawamuuza, “Aga golawila kohi Mkulu?” Naye nakawalonjela, “Hawele na mtufi, ndo hojimema mikungule.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Nhelo ilinguwala yafililwe na mlume na mtagusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Hamba Yesu nakawasimila walanguswa wa heye nhelo leka kuwalajila kota yanguwagana kulanda ne kugozola. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Nakalonga, “Kuli muji umwenga nakwali na mtagusa yumwe yawele hamdumbile Nguluwi ne kumlajila munhu igano. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Kuli muji wuwo nakwali na mdala yafililwe na mlume yawele nayali yoluta kwa heye chila mhela yomlanda yamhe hachi ya heye kulawa kwa mng'honyo wa heye. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kwa mhela winji ayo mtagusa nahaganile kumlewela ayo yafililwe na mlume, ila kuli kuduma nakelonjela, ‘Hanga hambe ndimdumbe Nguluwi ne kuwalajila wanhu igano, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ila kwa vila ayu yafililwe na mlume kangunhunya, ndoilewela hachi ya heye leka yaleche kunhosa kwa kuya chila mhela!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Lelo Mkulu nakalutilila kulonga, “Mhulichize ndaze vyoyalonjile ayo mtagusa yehile. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Ndaze, Nguluwi howalewela wala yawahagule, wala walingumlanda nemisi na nechilo? Kokawila kuwahulichiza? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ndangukulonjela kowalewela himahima. Ila ndaze, Mwana wa munhu hoyokuya kogafika makundo kuli isi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhelo ya Mfalisayo na mkongoza kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Hamba Yesu nakalonga nhelo ayi kwa wala wanhu walingiwona kota watanganika na kuwabeza wanji. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Nakalonga, “Wanhu weli nawaluta kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi kulanda, yumwe nayali Mfalisayo na yunji nayali mkongoza kodi.<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />“Ayo Mfalisayo nakema, nakalanda mnhumbula, ‘Gwa Nguluwi, ndangulonga malumbo kwa vila heni siwele kota wanhu wanji walinguboka na walingubunza na wang'hondwa ne kota ayu mkongoza kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ndangwesela kulya mazuwa meli kwa juma, ndangulavya zaka honhu hamwe ha kumi ha lufufu lwangu.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Ila yula mkongoza kodi nakema kutali ne henule meho gake kilanga, ila naketowa mhambaga kwa masinzo yolonga, ‘Gwa Nguluwi mbonele isungu heni ndiwele na gehile!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ndangukulonjelani, ayo mkongoza kodi nakahiluka kaye yawele yalechelwe gehile ga heye kusinda yula Mfalisayo. Kwa vila chila yalingikwiniza koduliswa na yoneche yochidulisa, kokwinizwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwatambichiza wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matei 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Malichi 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Wanhu nawamigalila Yesu wana wadodo yawawichile moko. Walanguswa wawawene nawawang'hanuchila. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ila Yesu nakawachema wala wana walute kwa heye, yolonga, “Muwaleche wana wadodo woye kwa heni, mleche kuwalemeza, kwa vila Undewa wa Nguluwi ndo wa wala wawele kota awa. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, munhu yoneche yohambe yaubochele Undewa wa Nguluwi kota mwana mdodo, hokwinjila kuli undewa awo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yawele na lufufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matei 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Malichi 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Chilongozi yumwe wa Wayahudi nakamuuza Yesu, “Mlangusa yanojile, ndite ndaze leka nyhalile ukomu wa mazuwa gose?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Lekachoni kwangunyhema nojile? Haduhu yawele yanojile ila Nguluwi yaliyeng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Kwangujizela mizilo, ‘Uleche kudita ung'hondwa, uleche kukopola, uleche kuhiza, uleche kulavya ulolezi wa udesi, uwahulichize mhaza na mayako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Heye nakedichila, “Ago geng'ha nandigabata kulawila londiwele msongolo.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu loyahuche ago nakamlonjela, “Kwanguganigwa kudita mbuli imwe, uguze chila chinhu, uwagawile wanzunwa, nagwe kowa na ng'hano kilanga, hamba uye umbinze.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ila ayo munhu loyahuliche ago nakawa na masinzo ng'hatu kwa vila nayali na lufufu lwinji.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu nakamlola, nakalonga, “Ulole vyoiwele ngondo kwa yawele na lufufu kwinjila kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ena, ndo ubewe ng'hatu kwa Ngamiya kukola kuli itubuli lya chihomo kusinda yawele na lufufu kwinjila kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Wala wanhu lowahuliche ago, nawalonga, “Whaani yoloholigwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu nakedichila, “Gowalingulemwela wanhu, kwa Nguluwi ganguditigwa.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Aho Petili nakamwidichila, “Natwe ndaze? Natuleka vinhu vyeng'ha vyotuwelenavyo natukuwinza!”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu nakawalonjela, ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, “Munhu yoneche yalechile ng'handa ama mche ama mng'holoze ama mhaza na mamo wa heye na wana kwa chiwalo cha Undewa wa Nguluwi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />kobochela menji ng'hatu kuli mhela awu na ukomu wa mazuwa gose kuli mhela ulinguya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulonga mala zidatu kuwala kubagama na kuzilipuka kwa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matei 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Malichi 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu nakawahola wala walanguswa wa heye kumi na weli, nakawalonjela, “Mhulichize! Twanguluta Yelusalemu na chila chinhu chandichigwe na waloli kuwala Mwana wa munhu, gokoligwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kwa vila kowichigwa kuli moko ga wanhu wohawamzelele Nguluwi, nawo wombeza na kumliga na kumtemela mite, womzapa ng'hobwa na kumkopola. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Naye kuli zuwa lya kadatu kozilipuka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ila hewo nahawavizelele mbuli ayo ne hado, nawali wavisigwe mana ya ulonzi awo, nahawavizelele choni chilingulonjigwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlohola yohambe yalole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matei 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Malichi 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Mhela Yesu loyawele habehi kufika Yeliko, nakwali na munhu yumwe yohambe yalole yawele yekalise mnzila yolanda utanzi. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Loyahuliche lung'hongola lwa wanhu lwangukola nakauza, “Hana choni?” <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Nawamlonjela, “Yesu wa Nasaleti kangukola.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Naye nakakwiniza lizi yolonga, “Yesu Mwana wa Daudi, umbonele isungu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Wala wanhu wamlongole nawamng'hanuchila, nawamlonjela yanyamalile, ila heye nakakwiniza lizi ng'hatu, “Mwana wa Daudi umbonele isungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu nakema, nakawalonjela wamigale yula munhu kwa heye. Loyafichile habehi, Yesu nakamuuza, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Kwangugana ndikuditile choni?” Naye nakedichila, “Mkulu ndangulanda ndole kahi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Ulole! Makundo ga hegwe nagakulohola.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Baho du yula yohambe yalole nakaluka kulola, nakamuwinza Yesu kuno yomtogola Nguluwi. Wanhu weng'ha lowaziwene mbuli azo nawamtogola Nguluwi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Sakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu nakenjila kuli muji wa Yeliko, nayali yokola kuli nzila za muji awo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Nakwali na munhu yumwe mng'hangala wa wakongoza kodi naye nayali na lufufu, itagwa lyake Sakayo. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Nakagana kumona Yesu kota ndo munhu wachi, ila kwa vila nakwali na lung'hongola lwa wanhu nakalemwela kumona kwa vila hawele ng'wemang'wema. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ahyo nakabilima kumwando, nakakwina mchanya mwa ikuyu leka yamone Yesu, kwa vila nayali yokola kuli nzila ayo. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu loyafichile honhu hala, nakalola mchanya nakamlonjela, “Sakayo, uduliche himahima kwa vila lehano ndowa mjenzi hakaye hako.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Sakayo nakadulika himahima, nakambochela kwa kusangalala. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Wanhu weng'ha lowagawene ago, nawaluka kung'hung'huta wolonga, “Nakaluta kikala kwa munhu yawele na gehile.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ila Sakayo nakenuka, nakamlonjela Yesu, “Uhulichize Mkulu! Heni ndowapa wazunwa nusu ya lufufu lwangu, wone nandimsukula munhu yoneche chinhu, ndomhilusila mala zine.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu nakamlonjela, “Lehano ulohozi nawinjila kuli ng'handa ayi, kwa vila ayu naye ndo mwana wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwa vila Mwana wa munhu nakoya kupala na kulohola chila chajilile.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhelo ya vitumagwa kumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matei 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Lowawele wohulichiza aga, Yesu nakalonga nhelo. Aho nayali habehi kufika Yelusalemu, wanhu awo nawejesa kota kuli mhela wuwo Undewa wa Nguluwi wokuya. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ahyo nakawalonjela, “Nakwali na munhu yumwe wa lukolo lwa chiundewa, nakadita majendo kuluta kuli isi ya kutali kuditigwa yawe mndewa, hamba yahiluche. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Ahyo nakawachema kumi hali vitumagwa wa heye, nakawapa sendi chila yumwe zihejile msahala wa myezi jidatu na kuwalonjela, ‘Mgulile na kuguza vinhu kwa sendi azi mbaka londihiluka.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ila wenyeng'haye wa isi ya heye nawamzudila, ahyo nawawalajiza wasenga walute kulonga, ‘Natumlema munhu ayu yawe chilongozi wa hetwe.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Munhu ayo nakahiluka hala du loyaditigwe kuwa mndewa, nakawachema wala vitumagwa loyawapele sendi leka yavizele mzidi chasi chachi chowapatile chila yumwe wa hewo kuli kugula na kuguza vinhu. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Chitumagwa wa mwaluko nakoya na kulonga, ‘Mkulu, kwa kiwhana na sendi zoumhele, namhata mzidi mala kumi ng'hatu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Heye nakamlonjela, ‘Goya, Hegwe ndo chitumagwa yanojile. Kwa vila nawali wa kukundigwa kuli mbuli ndodo, kolongoza kuli miji kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Chitumagwa wa keli nakoya, nakalonga, ‘Mkulu, namhata mzidi mala zihano ng'hatu ya sendi zoumhele.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Naye nakamlonjela, ‘Nagwe kolongoza kuli miji jihano.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Chitumagwa yunji nakoya, nakalonga, ‘Mkulu, uhole sendi zako, nandizivisa goya kuli chibende, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />kwa vila nandumba hegwe kwa munhu yang'ang'ale. Kwanguhola hala hawele hauwichile na kwangubeta hala hunyalile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Heye nakamlonjela, ‘Ndangukutagusa kwa kiwhana na ulonzi wa hegwe, hegwe kwa chitumagwa yehile! Nakuvizela kota heni nda munhu yang'ang'ale, ndiwele nguhola vyohaviwele vya heni na kubeta honhu hosinyalile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Lekachoni huwichile sendi za heni kwa walingwazika leka londihiluka nanyhole hamwe na mzidi?<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Aho nakawalonjela wala wawele hala, ‘Mumsukule sendi azo na mumhe yula yapatile mzidi mala kumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Nawo nawamlonjela, ‘Mkulu heye kana mzidi mala kumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Naye nakawedichila, ‘Ndanguwalonjela kota chila yawele na chinhu kokonjezelwa chiyage, ila yula yawele hela chinhu, chila chidodo choyawele nacho, kosukuligwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ila wala wang'honyo wa heni wawele hawaganile heni ndiwe mndewa wa hewo, muwegale na kuwakopola hali heni.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangwinjila Yelusalemu kwa luchenze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matei 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Malichi 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Loyasindile kulonga ago, Yesu nakalongola kuluta Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Loyawele habehi kufika Betifage na Betaniya, kuli chidunda chilinguchemigwa chidunda cha Mizeituni, nakawalajiza walanguswa wa heye weli, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />nakawalonjela, “Mlute kuli chijiji chiwele kumwando kwa hemwe. Lomkwinjila kuli chijiji, molifika idogowi lyana liwohigwe liwele halinawahika kukola mijito, mlidohole, mligale hano.<figure style="fig" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Idogowi lyana</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Wone munhu yowauza, ‘Lekachoni mwangulidohola?’ Mumlonjele, ‘Mkulu kanguligana.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Lelo nawaluta, nawafika hihila kota Yesu vyoyawalonjele. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Lowawele wolidohola lila lidogowi lyana, wenyeng'haye nawawauza, “Lekachoni mwangulidohola ali idogowi lyana?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Hewo walanguswa nawedichila, “Mkulu kanguligana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ahyo nawaligala lila idogowi lyana kwa Yesu. Hamba nawatambalika nguwo za hewo mchanya mwa alyo idogowi lyana na kumkwiniza Yesu mchanya mwake. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu loyawele yoluta kuno yawele mchanya mwa idogowi, wanhu nawatambalika mivalo ja hewo kuli nzila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Loyawele habehi na honhu halingwaluchila viduliko vya chidunda cha Mizeituni, chilundo cheng'ha cha walanguswa wa heye nawaluka kumtogola Nguluwi kwa kusangalala kwa lizi likulu kwa chiwalo cha madito geng'ha ga vinduzanduza gowagonile, nawalonga, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />“Nakatambichizwa Mndewa yalinguya kwa itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi. Kikala goya ako kilanga na ukulu ako Kuchanya!” <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Wamwe wa mafalisayo wawele hala hali chilundo cha wanhu, nawamlonjela, “Mlangusa,” “Walonjele walanguswa wa hegwe wanyamalile!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Ndangukulonjela, wone wano wonyamalila, ndikomya, ago maganga gokwiniza lizi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguulilila muji wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Loyawele habehi na Yelusalemu na kuwona muji, Yesu nakaulilila, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />yolonga, “Wone wahavizelele lehano mbuli zilingigala kikala goya! Ila lelo nazivisigwa kuli meho ga hegwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kwa vila mazuwa ganguya gawele wang'honyo wa hegwe wokuzunguluta kuli banzi zeng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Wokuhonda hegwe na wana wa hegwe wawele mgati mwa ng'hanzi za hegwe, hawokulechela ne iganga limwe mchanya mwa iganga liyage, kwa vila hauuzelele mhela Nguluwi loyoyile kukulohola.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangwinjila kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matei 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Malichi 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Hamba Yesu nakenjila kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakaluka kuwawinga wala wawele ngugula na kuguza vinhu amo, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />yolonga, “Nayandichigwa, ‘Ng'handa ya heni yowa ng'handa ya kulandila.’ Ila hemwe namuidita kuwa mhalika ya walinguboka.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Chila zuwa Yesu nayali yolangusa kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Ila watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na vilongozi wa wanhu nawagana kumkopola, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ila nawalemwela kwa vila wanhu weng'ha nawamuwinza na kumhulichiza goya.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli kuwala ludali lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matei 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Malichi 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Zuwa limwe, Yesu loyawele yowalangusa wanhu kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi na kuwikula Mbuli Inojile, watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa hamwe na wasekulu nawafika, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />nawalonga, “Tulonjele! Kwangudita mbuli azi kwa ludali lwachi? Whaani yakupele ludali alu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu nakawedichila. “Nani ndowauza, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />ludali lwa Yohani lwa kubatiza nalulawa kilanga kwa Nguluwi ama kwa wanhu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Ila hewo nawalongasa hewo kwa hewo wolonga, “Wone tulonje nalulawa kwa Nguluwi, kotuuza, ‘Lekachoni hamumkundile?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Wone tulonje nalulawa kwa wanhu, wanhu weng'ha wa hano wotutowa na maganga, kwa vila weng'ha nawakunda kota Yohani nayali mloli wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Lelo nawamlonjela, “Hatuvizelele ludali alo nalulawa kohi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Nani siwalonjela ndangudita mbuli azi kwa ludali lwachi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhelo kuwala walimi na mgunda wa zabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matei 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Malichi 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu nakalutilila kuwalonjela wanhu nhelo ayi, “Munhu yumwe nakalima mgunda wa zabibu, nakawabasila walimi, hamba nakaluta kuli isi ya kutali, nakekala ako kwa mihela minji. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Mhela wa kubeta, munhu ayo nakamlajiza chitumagwa wa heye kwa wala yawabasile mgunda leka wamhe honhu ha mafuza ga mgunda wa zabibu. Ila wala walimi nawamsubula ayo chitumagwa na kumhilusa ne chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Yula munhu nakamlajiza chitumagwa yunji, ila hewo nawamtowa ayo chitumagwa na kumbasa soni na kumhilusa ne chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nakamlajiza chitumagwa wa kadatu, ayo kahi nawamlumiza na kumtaga hanze ha mgunda. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yula yawele na mgunda nakejesa, ‘Ndodita choni? Ndomlajiza mwana wa heni yondimganile, hanji womhulichiza.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Wala walimi lowamuwene, nawelonjela, ‘Ayu ndo mhalizi. Lelo tumkopole leka uhalizi wa heye uwe wa hetwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Lelo nawamlavya hanze ha mgunda wa mizabibu, nawamkopola.” Yesu nakauza, “Yula yawele na mgunda kowadita choni wala walimi? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Kokuya kuwadumya wala walimi na kowabasila walimi wanji awo mgunda wa zabibu.” Wanhu lowahuliche ulonzi awo nawalonga, “Hebu! Galeche kulawila ne hado!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ila Yesu nakawalola, nakawalonjela, “Maandiko Matakatifu gana mana yachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">“ ‘Iganga lyowalilemile walinguzenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">naliwa iganga likulu lya msisi!’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Wone munhu yoneche yogwa mchanya mwa iganga alyo, kobeneka vihande vihande na wone iganga alyo lyomgwila munhu yoneche, lyomhondanga.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kulavya kodi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matei 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Malichi 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa na watambika wakulu nawavizela kuwala nhelo ayo ilinguwawala hewo, ahyo nawagana kumibata bahala, ila nawawadumba wanhu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Lelo, nawali wopala mhela unojile. Nawawapala wanhu wedite kota wanoga, nawawalajiza leka wamgwilize Yesu kwa kumuuza, ahyo nawali wogana wamibate na kumhilika kwa wakulu wa isi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Wala wapugajizi nawamlonjela, “Mlangusa, tuvizela hegwe kwangulangusa ga kukomya ne hambe umbagule munhu, ila kwangulangusa nzila za Nguluwi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Lelo tulonjele iwa goya kumha mndewa wa Loma kodi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesu nakavizela chowalingugana, ahyo nakawalonjela, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Mndajile sendi ayo. Ndaze, mutwi na itagwa ali ndo lya whaani?”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Nawedichila, “Ndo vya Kaisali.” Yesu nakawalonjela, “Goya, mmigalile Kaisali gawele ga Kaisali na mmigalile Nguluwi gawele ga Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Aho hali wanhu walemwela kumgwiliza, wekala tulu wochijesa vyoyawalonjele.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwala mbuli ya kuzilipuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matei 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Malichi 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Wala Masadukayo, wawele wangulongaga kota wabagame hambe wazilipuche, nawoya kwa Yesu, nawalonga, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Mlangusa, Musa nakatwandichila kuwa one mng'holozo yumwe yabagame na kumleka mche wa heye ne mwana, leka ayo munhu yumwe wa lukolo lwenu yamhalile ayo mdala, yamlelele wana mng'holoze. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Lelo mhela umwe kwali na wanhu saba wa lukolo lumwe. Yula wamwaluko kamhola, hamba nakabagama ne kulela mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Mng'holoze wa keli nakamhola yula mdala mlekwa, naye kahi nakabagama ne mwana <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />na wakadatu naye nakamhesa, naye hiho nakabagama. Nayali hihyo kwa weng'ha saba nawabagama ne kuleka mwana kwa yula mdala. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Hamba yula mdala naye nakabagama. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Lelo zuwa lya wabagame kuzilipuka mdala ayo kowa mche wa whaani? Mina weng'ha saba nawali wamhesile.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Walume na wadala wa mihela aji wanguhesa na kuhesigwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ila wala wawele Nguluwi yowawika mbaka mhela wa kuzilipuka, howohesa ne kuhesigwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Awo howobagama kahi, kwa vila, wowa kota wahilisi. Hewo ndo wana wa Nguluwi, kwa vila ndo wana wa wanhu wazilipuligwe. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Ila kuzilipuka kwa wabagame, Musa kahi nakakunda mbuli azo kuli gandichigwe gelile. Yolajila hala honhu hali chisosolo lochali chikwaka chiluli ne kulakala, loyali yomchema Mkulu Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa Abulahamu na Nguluwi wa Isaka na Nguluwi wa Yakubu. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Heye hawele Nguluwi wa wanhu wabagame, ila Nguluwi wa wanhu wakomu, mina kwa heye weng'ha wakomu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa nawalonga, “Mlangusa kwidichila goya ng'hatu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Nawalonga ahyo kwa vila nakwali haduhu munhu yoneche wa kumuuza kahi.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli kuwala Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matei 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Malichi 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu nakawauza, “Naiwa ndaze wanhu wangulonga Kilistu ndo mwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Kwa vila Daudi yuye kangulonga kuli chitabu cha Zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">“ ‘Mkulu, nakamlonjela Mkulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">wikalise ubanzi heni wa kudilo,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />mbaka ndiwawiche wang'honyo wa hegwe, wawe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:43">chigoda cha kuwichila magulu ga hegwe.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Wone Daudi kangumchema heye, ‘Mkulu,’ Lelo yowa ndaze, Kilistu yawe mwana wa Daudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwakanya wanhu kuwala walangusa wa malajizo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matei 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Malichi 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Yesu nakawalonjela walanguswa wa heye hali wanhu weng'ha, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Milolele na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa wawele wanguganaga kulamswa na wanhu kwa kuhulichiza kuli honhu ha kugula na kuguza vinhu na kikalisa honhu ha lutogo kuli masunagogi na kuhola honhu ha lutogo kuli mnvina. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Wanguwabunzaga wafililwe na walume wa hewo, wangiditaga kota wanoga kwa kulanda kwa sala zihejile. Wanhu kota wano wotaguswa kwa kung'hang'hala ng'hatu!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Ndolendole ya yafililwe na mlume wa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Malichi 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu nakalola, nakawona wawele na lufufu wowika ndolendole za hewo kuli ng'hano ya ng'handa ya Nguluwi, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />kahi nakamona yafililwe na mlume wa heye yolavya migwala mili midodo kuli ng'hano ayo. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Nakalonga, “Ndikomya ndangukulonjelani, mamo ayu yafililwe na mlume wa heye nakalavya chasi chikulu kusinda wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kwa vila wanhu weng'ha nawalavya kwa kiwhana na mzidi wa lufufu lwawo, ila ayu mamo nakalavya kwa kiwhana na uzunwa wa heye, vyeng'ha vyoyawele navyo mbaka chila choyalinguchigana leka yekale.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulavya uloli kuwala kuwifigwa kwa ng'handa ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matei 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Malichi 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Walanguswa wamwe nawali wolonga kuwala Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, ndaze vyoinoligwe kwa maganga ga sendi nyinji hamwe na ndolendole zilingulavigwa kwa Nguluwi. Yesu nakalonga, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Aga geng'ha gomlingugona aha, mazuwa ganguya gawele haduhu ne iganga limwe lyosigala mchanya mwa iganga liyage, chila chinhu chowifigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magazo na kugazigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matei 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Malichi 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Lelo, nawamuuza Yesu, “Mlangusa, mbuli azo zolawila nili? Ulajilo wachi wolajila kota mbuli azo zahabehi kulawila?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu nakawedichila, “Milolele, mleche kuhadigwa. Kwa vila wenji wokuya kwa itagwa lya heni, wolonga, ‘Heni ndo Kilistu,’ mhela awo wa habehi. Ila hemwe mleche kuwawinza! <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Lelo lomhulika mbuli za ngondo na ivuche, mleche kudumba, kwa vila ago golongola kulawila, ila kuduma kwa geng'ha kung'hali.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Hamba nakalutilila kulonga, “Isi imwe yochitowa na isi iyage na undewa umwe wochitowa na undewa uyage. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Chila honhu howa na jimachinyina mikulu, lufemba na matamwa. Kowa na mbuli za kukabusa na ulajilo ukulu kilanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ila kung'hali kulawila ago, wowabata na kuwagaza na kuwahilika kuli masunagogi na kuwawika mchinweng'ho, mohilikwa kuli wandewa na walingulongoza kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heni, <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />leka mlavye ulolezi hali hewo. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Muwe na kunuwila kuno kuli nhumbula za hemwe. Mleche kijesa kung'hali mhela kuwala ndaze vyomlonga kuli kulonjelezwa, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />kwa vila heni ndowapa ulonzi na luhala luwele haduhu ne mng'honyo wa hemwe yoweza kitwanza ne kulema. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Mobelenhukwa mbaka na wahaza na mamo wa hemwe na wang'holozenu na wagoloko wa hemwe na wamwe wa hemwe wokopoligwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Wanhu weng'ha wowazudila hemwe kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya heni. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ila haikwajilila ne mnvili imwe kuli vitwi vya hemwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kwa kwimilila kwa hemwe, moulohola ukomu wa hemwe.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulavya uloli kuwala kuwifigwa kwa muji wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matei 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Malichi 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Homkona muji wa Yelusalemu nauzungulutwa na wamizi, mvizele kota mhela wa kuwifigwa kwa muji awo naufika. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Aho wawele Yudeya wabilime kuluta kuli vidunda na wawele kuli muji walawe na wawele kuli migunda waleche kuhiluka kuli muji. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwa vila mazuwa ago ndo mazuwa ga kugazika, leka geng'ha gandichigwe genele. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Wochona wawele na himila na walingonyeza kuli mazuwa ago! Kwavila kowa na kugazika kukulu kuli isi na ng'halazi ya Nguluwi yokuya kwa wanhu awa. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Wanji wakopoligwa kwa ipanga na wanji woholigwa upogozi kuli isi zeng'ha na muji wa Yelusalemu wobigangwa na wanhu isi zinji, mbaka mhela wa hewo houkwenela.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuya kwa mwana wa munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matei 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Malichi 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Kowa na ulajilo kuli isanya na nyelezi na nhondwe. Hano muisi, wanhu wa isi wowa kuli kugazika kwa chiwalo cha lunhwinhwi lwa kutigasika kwa nhigu za bahali. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Wanhu wowa habehi kubagama kwa lunhwinhwi na kuzona zila mbuli zilingulawila muisi, kwa vila mong'ho wa kilanga wotigaswa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Hamba womona Mwana wa munhu yokuya kuli ng'hungugu, yawele na ludali na welile winji. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Mhela mbuli ayo hoikwaluka kulawila, mwime na kwinula mitwi vya hemwe mchanya, kwa vila ugombozi wa hemwe wa habehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhelo ya igodi la mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matei 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Malichi 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Hamba nakawalonjela nhelo, “Mlole igodi lya mtini na migodi jinji jeng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Hojizuka, mwanguvizela kota mhela wa kubeta wa habehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Hihyo du, homkona mbuli azo zangulawila, movizela kota Undewa wa Nguluwi wa habehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Ndikomya ndanguwalonjela, lulelo alu lwa sambi halukola kung'hali mbuli azi zeng'ha kulawila. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Ulanga na isi zopuluta, ila ulonzi wa heni haupuluta.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yanguganigwa kuwa meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Muwe meho leka nhumbula za hemwe zileche kutunyigwa na mbuli nyinji za kuli ukomu awu, one haiwele ahyo zuwa alyo lyokuya kwa hemwe baho du. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kwa vila lyokuya kota idiwa kwa weng'ha walingikala muisi yeng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Muwe meho mazuwa gose na mlande leka muweze kuloholigwa na gala geng'ha hogolawila na kwima hali Mwana wa munhu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Mhela wa nemisi, Yesu nayali yowalangusa wanhu kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, ila nechilo nayali yoluta kuli chidunda cha Mizeituni na kikala ako. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Wanhu weng'ha nawali woluta kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi kung'hali lufuku, leka wamhulichize.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Kiwika goya kumkopola Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matei 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Malichi 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Mnvina ya mibumunda johajiwichigwe usaso, ilinguchemigwa Pasaka, nayali habehi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa nawali wopala ndaze vyowomkopola Yesu, ila nawawadumba wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kangukunda kumbelenhuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matei 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Malichi 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Lelo, Limazoga nalimwinjila Yudasi yalinguchemigwa Isikalioti, yumwe wa wala walanguswa kumi na weli. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yuda nakaluta kwa wakulu wa watambika na wamizi wa Ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nakalonga nawo kuwala vila vyoyombelenhuka Yesu kwa hewo. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Nawo nawasangalala na nawalagana kumha sendi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudasi nakakunda na kazangupala mhela uwele goya wa kumbelenhuka Yesu kwa hewo, mhela uwele haduhu lung'hongola lwa wanhu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwika goya chilyo cha mnvina ya Pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matei 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Malichi 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Lelo, zuwa lya mibumunda johajiwichigwe usaso nalifika. Alyo ndo zuwa liwele lyana ing'holo lya mnvina ya Pasaka lyangudumuligwa singo. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Ahyo Yesu nakawalajiza Petili na Yohani nakawalonjela, “Mlute mkatugongomanyile mnvina ya Pasaka tulye.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Nawo nawamuuza, “Kohi koulingugana tukugongomanyile?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Nakawedichila, “Mhulichize! Lomuwa mluta mjini, moting'hana na mlume yawele yedwichile chiya cha mazi. Mumuwinze mbaka kuli ng'handa hoyokwinjila. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mumlonjele yawele na ng'handa, ‘Mlangusa kanguuza, chakohi chila chihengo cha wajenzi, chiwele heni na walanguswa wa heni todila Pasaka?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Naye kowalajila chihengo chikulu cha mchanya chiwele chinoligwe goya. Mgongomanye amo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Lelo nawaluta, nawafika chila chinhu kota Yesu vyoyawalonjele, nawagongomanya mnvina ya Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnvina ya Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matei 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Malichi 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Mhela loufichile, Yesu nakekalisa kuli chisaga kulya chilyo hamwe na vitumagwa wa heye. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Nakawalonjela, “Nangana ng'hatu kulya hamwe na hemwe mnvina ayi ya Pasaka nding'hali kugazigwa! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kwa vila ndanguwalonjela, silya kahi mbaka aho hoikwenela kuli Undewa wa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Hamba nakachihola chizombe cha divai, nakatambichiza, nakalonga, “Mbochele, munwe mweng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Kwa vila ndanguwalonjela, hambe nyinwe kahi divai ya zabibu mbaka Undewa wa Nguluwi houkuya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Hamba kahola ibumunda, nakatambichiza na nakalimogola, nakawapa walanguswa wa heye yolonga, “Alu ndo lukuli lwa heni, loulavigwa kwa chiwalo cha hemwe. Mdite ahi kwa kung'humbuchila heni.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Hihyo du lowasindindile kulya, nakachihola chizombe, yolonga, “Chizombe achi ndo ilagano inyale kuli danda ya heni, ilingubohoka kwa chiwalo cha hemwe.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Ila mlole! Yula yombelenhuka ka hamwe na heni hano mchisaga. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Ndikomya Mwana wa munhu kanguluta kukopoligwa kota vyoinuwilwe, ila kochona munhu yula yalingumhinduka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Aho nawaluka kiwuza hewo wawo ndo whaani hali hewo yodita mbuli ayo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitwanza kuwala ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Nakulawila kitwanza hali walanguswa kuwala whaani hali hewo yalingujesigwa kowa mkulu kusinda wanji. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Wandewa wa wanhu wa isi wanguwalongozaga wanhu kwa lupichi, nawo wanguchemigwa ‘Wawele na isungu kwa wanhu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ila hemwe mleche kiwhana na hewo, ila yula yawele mkulu hali hemwe naimgana yawe mdodo kusinda weng'ha na yalingulongoza naimgana yawe kota chitumagwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Kwa vila ndo whaani yawele mkulu? Yula yalingikalisa mchisaga na kulya, ama yula yalingumkolela mijito? Ne lunhwinhwi ndo yula yalingikalisa mchisaga na kulya! Ila heni nda hano hali hemwe kota chitumagwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Hemwe ndo msigale na heni kuli mhela weng'ha wa kujezigwa kwa heni, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />kota mhaza wa heni vyoyamhele undewa, hihyo du nani ndowapa hemwe undewa. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Molya na kunwa mchisaga cha heni kuli undewa wa heni na kikalisa kuli vigoda vya undewa na kuzitagusa nhanzi kumi na mbili za Isilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangulagula kota Petili kombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matei 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Malichi 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesu nakalonga, “Simoni, Simoni! Uhulichize! Limazoga lyangugana kuwabeta hemwe kota munhu yobeta uhemba. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ila heni nandanda kwa chiwalo cha hegwe leka makundo ga hegwe galeche kuwa mado. Nagwe hounhyiluchila, uwakangaze nhumbula wang'holozo.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Naye Petili nakedichila, “Mkulu, heni nang'hunda kuluta nagwe mchinweng'ho na mbaka kubagama.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Ndangukulonjela hegwe Petili, kung'hali izogolo halineka lehano kombela mala zidatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhela wihile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Hamba Yesu nakawauza walanguswa wa heye, “Mhela londiwalajize ne mhako wa sendi ne makwamba, nampunguchilwa ne chinhu choneche?” Nawamwidichila, “Hatupunguchilwe na chinhu choneche.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Naye nakawalonjela, “Ila sambi yoneche yawele na mhako wa sendi yauhole na yoneche yalihela ipanga, yaguze ikoti lyake leka yagule ipanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwa vila ndanguwalonjela, uno ulonzi wa Maandiko Matakatifu, ‘Nakawichigwa kuli chilundo chimwe na wehile.’ Wangulapigwa wenele. Ena, gandichigwe kuwala heni gangwenela.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Walanguswa wa heye nawamlonjela, “Mkulu ulole hano hana mipanga mili.” Naye nakawedichila, “Ihega!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangumlanda kuli chidunda cha mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matei 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Malichi 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu nakoka na kuluta kuli chidunda cha Mizeituni kota vyoyazowele, nawo walanguswa wa heye nawamuwinza. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Lowafichile ako nakawalonjela, “Mlande leka mleche kwinjila kuli kujezigwa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Hamba nakawaleka, nakaluta honhu hatali hado ha munhu kutoza iganga, nakafugama, nakalanda <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />nakalonga, “Mhaza wone ulingugana, umbusile chino chizombe achi. Haiwele kota vyondilingugana, ila kota vyoulingugana hegwe gakoleche.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Aho mhilisi kulawa kilanga nakamlawila leka kumkangaza nhumbula. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Naye loyawele kuli usungu ukulu, nakalanda kwa kikangaza ng'hatu, chituguti cha heye nachiwa kota midovu ja danda, chiwele nachilagala hali misanga.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Loyasindile kulanda, nakahiluka kwa walanguswa wa heye, nakawafika wawasile, kwa vila nawali na masinzo. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Naye nakawauza, “Lekachoni namuwasa? Mwinuche mlande, mleche kwinjila kuli kujezigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubatigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matei 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Malichi 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohana 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu loyawele yolutilila kulonga, chilundo cha wanhu chilongozwe na Yudasi, yumwe wa wala walanguswa kumi na weli, nachuya. Yuda nakaluta kumlamsa Yesu kwa kumnonela. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ila Yesu nakamlonjela, “Yudasi! Ndaze, kwangumbelenhuka Mwana wa munhu kwa kumnonela?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Wala walanguswa wa Yesu lowagawene ago nawalonga, “Mkulu tuwateme kwa mipanga?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Yumwe wa hewo nakamtowa chitumagwa wa mtambika mkulu kwa ipanga nakamtema ikutu lya kudilo. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ila Yesu nakalonga, “Leka! Ihega.” Nakalidoliza lila ikutu lya yula munhu, nakawa mkomu.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Hamba Yesu nakawalonjela watambika wakulu na wakulu wa wamizi wa ng'handa ya Nguluwi na wasekulu wawele nawoya kumibata, “Ndaze, namuya na mipanga na nyhimbati kumbata heni kota hila nda yalinguboka? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Lombele hamwe na hemwe chila zuwa kuli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi hamimbate. Ila awu ndo mhela wa hemwe, ndo mhela wa ulongozi wa jiza.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kangumbela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matei 26:57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Malichi 14:53-54</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ahyo nawamibata Yesu, nawamhola na kuluta naye haluga ha mtambika mkulu. Petili nakawinza kwa kutali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Nawabwina chiluli hagati ha lugagala na kikalisa hamwe, naye Petili nayali hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Chitumagwa yumwe mdala loyamuwene Petili yekalise habehi na chiluli, nakamnugulila meho, nakalonga, “Munhu ayu kahi nayali hamwe na Yesu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ila Petili nakabela, nakalonga, “Gwa! Mdala, simzelele.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Hamba munhu yunji nakamona Petili, nakalonga, “Hegwe ndo yumwe wa hewo.” Ila Petili nakedichila, “Mkulu, siwele heni!” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Hoikwete saa imwe, munhu yunji nakakangaza kwa kulonga, “Ndangukomya, munhu yuno nayali hamwe na Yesu, kwa vila heye naye ka Mgalilaya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ila Petili nakalonga, “Mkulu, sivizelele choulingulonga!” Baho du loyawele yang'hali yolonga, izogolo nalika. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Yesu nakahinduka na kumlola Petili, naye Petili nakakumbuchila gala goyalonjelwe Yesu, “Lehano kung'hali izogolo halineka, kombela mala zidatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petili nakalawa kunze, nakalila kwa masinzo.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubezigwa na kutowigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matei 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Malichi 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Wala wanhu lowawele womlolela Yesu, nawamtowa na kumbeza. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Nawamuwoha chibende kumeho, nawamuuza, “Ulavye uloli, whaani yakutowile?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Nawo nawalutilila kumliga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguhilikwa kuli chitala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matei 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Malichi 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Lokubwemwenzuche, chitala cha wasekulu nachikoleka, mina ndo watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo, naweting'hana hamwe. Yesu nakegaligwa hali chitala acho. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Nawo nawamlonjela, “Utulonjele! Ndaze, hegwe ndo Kilistu?” Ila Yesu nakawalonjela, “Wone ndikulonjeleni hamkunda <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />na wone ndowauza, hamkwidichila. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ila kulawa sambi, Mwana wa munhu kochikala ubanzi wa kudilo wa Nguluwi Yawele na Mong'ho.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Aho weng'ha nawamuuza, “Lelo hegwe ndo Mwana wa Nguluwi?” Naye nakawedichila, “Hemwe ndo mwangulonga kota heni nda mwana wa Nguluwi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Nawo nawalonga, “Ndaze, twangugana ulolezi wunji? Natuhulika yolonga kwa mlomo wa heye yuye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kangugaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matei 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Malichi 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Hamba, wanhu weng'ha nawenuka, nawamigala Yesu kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Nawaluka kumlonjeleza wolonga, “Natumfika munhu ayu yowahada wanhu wa hetwe, yowalemeza kulavya kodi kwa mndewa wa Loma na kichema heye ndo Kilistu, mndewa.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato nakamuuza Yesu, “Hegwe kwa mndewa wa Wayahudi?” Yesu nakedichila, “Hegwe kulonga.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato nakawalonjela watambika wakulu na lung'hongola lwa wanhu, “Hambe mbone nongwa yoneche ya kumtagusa munhu ayu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ila hewo nawakangaza kwa kulonga, “Kangwambuza ivuche kwa malanguso ga heye kuli isi yeng'ha ya Yuda, nakaluchila Galilaya na sambi ka hano.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangugaligwa kwa Helodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato loyahuliche ago, nakauza, “Munhu ayu ka Mgalilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Loyavizelele kota Yesu nayali hali ulongozi wa Helodi, nakamigala kwa Helodi, yawele mhela awo nayali Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helodi loyamuwene Yesu nakasangalala ng'hatu, kwa vila kwa mhela winji nayali yahuliche mbuli nyinji zilingumuwala heye. Mzidi wa ago nayali yogana kumona yodita vinduzanduza. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Lelo nakamuuza mbuli nyinji kwa mhela winji, ila Yesu hedichile ne chinhu. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Watambika wakulu na walangusa wa malajizo ga Musa, nawoya kumlonjeleza Yesu kwa lupichi ng'hatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Helodi hamwe na wamizi wa heye nawambasa soni Yesu na kumditila idaba, hamba nawamvaliza ivalo lya chiundewa, nawamhilusa kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Kuli zuwa alyo Helodi na Pilato nawawa goloko, kung'hali kwa mbuli ayi nawali wang'honyo.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangutagusigwa yabagame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matei 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Malichi 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilato nakawachema watambika wakulu na vilongozi na wanhu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />nakawalonjela, “Nammigala munhu ayu kwa heni, namlonga kota nayali yowahada wanhu. Lelo mhulichize! Lomhugajize hali hemwe, siiwene nongwa yoneche kuwala ulonjelezi wa hemwe kwa heye. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Ne Helode hamuwene na nongwa yoneche, ndo chiwalo cha kumhilusa kwa hetwe. Kota vyomlingona, munhu ayu haditile mbuli yoneche ilingumlapa kubagama. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ahyo ndokundiza yazapigwe ng'hobwa hamba ndomlechela.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kwa vila nayali kanguganigwa kumlechela munhu yumwe kwa wala wawele mchinweng'ho kuli Mnvina ya Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ila weng'ha nawatowa iyowe, “Umuse munhu ayo na mchumulile Balaba kwa hetwe!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balaba nayali yawichigwe mchinweng'ho kwa chiwalo cha kwambuza kubelenhuka kuli muji kahi kwa chiwalo cha kukopola.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato nakagana kumlechela Yesu, ahyo nakalonga na hewo kahi, <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />ila hewo nawalutilila kutowa iyowe, “Mumuwambe, mumuwambe!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato nakawauza lwa kadatu, “Nakadita wihe wachi? Hambembone nongwa yoneche kwa heye ilingumuwala kubagama, ahyo ndowakundiza yazapigwe ng'hobwa, hamba ndomlechela.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ila hewo nawalutilila kutowa iyowe kwa mong'ho ng'hatu, wolonga kota Yesu yawambigwe, ahyo iyowe lya hewo nalisumya. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ahyo Pilato nakalavya utaguso kota wadite vyowalingugana. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Nakamchumulila kulawa mchinweng'ho yula wamganile, yawele nakawichigwa mchinweng'ho kwa kwambuza kubelenhuka na kukopola, nakamlavya Yesu kwa hewo wamditile kota vyowalingugana.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwambigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matei 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Malichi 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Lowawele womuhilika, naweting'hana na munhu yumwe yalinguchemigwa Simoni mwenyeng'haye wa Kulene, yawele nayali yolawa kumgunda. Lelo nawamibata, nawamdwika ula msalaba yauhole kumwando kwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Lung'hongola lwa wanhu nalumuwiza Yesu, hali olo lung'hongola nawali wadala wawele womlilila na kumlombochezela. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu nakawagalamchila, nakalonga, “Hemwe wadala wa Yelusalemu! Mleche kundilila heni, ila mililile mwemwe na kwa chiwalo cha wana wa hemwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwa vila ndikomya, kwa vila mazuwa ganguya molonga, ‘Fola wala wawele mhende, wawele hawanawahika kuponda ne konhyeza wana!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Mhela awo wanhu wokwaluka kuvilonjela vidunda vikulu, ‘Tugwile!’ Na vidunda vidodo, ‘Tugubiche!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kwa vila wone nawadita ahi kuli igodi idodi, yowa ndaze kuli igodi likalile?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Nawawahola kahi wanhu wanji weli wawele na nongwa, wabagame hamwe na heye. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Lowafichile honhu halinguchemigwa Izeje lya Mutwi, aho ndo nawamuwamba Yesu hamwe na wala wawele na nongwa, yumwe kuli ubanzi wa kudilo na yumwe kuli ubanzi wa kumoso. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu nakalonga, “Mhaza uwalechele kwa vila hawavizelele chowalingudita.” Hamba nawegawila mivalo ja heye kwa kujitowela simbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Wanhu nawali wemile aho womlola. Nawo vilongozi nawambeza wolonga, “Nakawalohola wanhu wanji, lelo yelohole yuye, kota heye ndo Kilistu yahaguligwe na Nguluwi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Nawo wamizi nawambeza, nawamlutila na kumbaka sichi, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />wolonga, “Wilohole gwegwe wone hegwe ndo uli Mndewa wa Wayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Kuli msalaba mchanya mwa mutwi wa heye, nakwandichigwa, “Ayu ndo Mndewa wa Wayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Yumwe wa wala wawele na nongwa wawambigwe hamwe na Yesu nakamliga, yolonga, “Hambi hegwe hauwele Kilistu? Lelo wilohole gwegwe na hetwe.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ila yula yawele na nongwa yunji, nakamng'hanuchila myage, yolonga, “Hegwe hambe umdumbe Nguluwi? Hegwe nagwe kwa mumo kuli kutagusigwa kota heye. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Hetwe, twangutagusigwa hano kwa mbuli zihile zotuditile. Ila ayu munhu haditile ne nongwa yoneche.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Hamba nakamlonjela Yesu, “Gwa Yesu! Ung'humbuche loukwinjila kuli Undewa wa hegwe.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu nakamwidichila, “Ndikomya ndangukulonjela lehano kowa hamwe na heni kuli lubehelo kwa Nguluwi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kangubagama kuli msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matei 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Malichi 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Nayali kota saa sita nemisi, isanya nalileka kulangaza, jiza naligubika isi yeng'ha mbaka saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />ipaziya lya Ng'handa ya Nguluwi nalidejeka kuli vihande vili. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu nakalila kwa lizi likulu, yolonga, “Mhaza, kuli moko ga hegwe ndanguwika muhe wa heni.” Loyalonjile ago, nakabagama.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Aho yula chilongozi wa wamizi, loyagawene galawile, nakamtogola Nguluwi yolonga, “Ndikomya ayu nayali munhu yatanganiche.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Wanhu weng'ha wawele nawekungajiza aho kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayo, lowagawene ago galawile nawahiluka haluga kwa hewo kuno chila yumwe yotowa mhambaga wa heye kwa masinzo. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Wala weng'ha wamzelele hamwe na wala wadala wamuwinzile kulawa Galilaya, nawema kutali wolola mbuli ayo.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukuli lwa Yesu lwangutiligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matei 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Malichi 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Nakwali na munhu yumwe itagwa lyake Yusufu, mwenyeng'haye wa chijiji chimwe cha Wayahudi chilinguchemigwa Alimataya. Nayali yumwe wa wasekulu wa chitala, nayali munhu wa hachi. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Nayali yobeteza kuya kwa Undewa wa Nguluwi. Hanga nayali yumwe wa watagusa kuli chitala chikulu, nahakundile chila chowadile wayage. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ila heye nakaluta kwa Pilato, nakalanda yapegwe lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Nakaludulisa lukuli alo kulawa kuli msalaba, nakaluwoha kwa sanda ya kitani inojile na kuluwika kuli chilaga chihongoligwe kuli italawe chiwele ching'hali kutiligwa munhu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Zuwa alyo nalyali Ijumaa na kiwika goya kwa Zuwa lya Kwesela nakwali habehi kwaluka.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Wala wadala welongoze na Yesu kulawa Galilaya nawamuwinza Yusufu, nawachona chila chilaga na ndaze lukuli lwa Yesu vyoluwichigwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Hamba nawahiluka haluga, nawahola unhunyhililo na malihamu, nawalubakaliza lukuli lwa Yesu. Zuwa lya Kwesela, nawesela kota vyoiwichigwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kuzilipuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matei 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Malichi 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Kuli zuwa lya mwaluko lufuku ng'hatu, wala wadala nawahola wula unhunyililo wowauwichile goya, nawaluta kuli chilaga. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Nawalifika lila iganga lidinyile chilaga, liwichigwe kutali na chilaga.<figure style="fig" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:2">Iganga lihejezwe hafungo mwa chilaga</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Lowenjile mgati, hawaluwene lukuli lwa Mkulu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Lowawele wabubuwale kuwala mbuli ayo, baho du wanhu weli wavalile mivalo jilingupulika lukami kota lumwemwesa, nawema habehi na hewo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Awo wadala nawawa na lunhwinhwi, nawenamiza hasi. Aho wala wanhu nawawalonjela, “Lekachoni mwangumpala yawele mkomu kuli wabagame? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Kahaduhu hano, nakazilipuka. Mkumbuchile choyawalonjele loyawele kula Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Yanguganigwa Mwana wa munhu yalavigwe kwa wanhu wehile, nawo womuwamba na zuwa lya kadatu kozilipuka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Aho wala wadala nawaukumbuchila ulonzi wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Lowahiluche kulawa kuli chilaga, nawawalonjela wala walanguswa kumi na yumwe na wanhu weng'ha kuwala mbuli azo zeng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Awo walonjile mbuli azo kwa watumigwa ndo, Maliya Madelena na Yohana na Maliya mayake Yakubu na wadala wanji walutile hamwe kuli chilaga. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ila watumigwa hawakundile ulonzi awo wa awo wadala, kwa vila ulonzi awo nawoneka kota upoka. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ila Petili nakalawa, nakaluta yobilima mbaka kuli chilaga. Loyafichile, nakenamiza na kusunjilila mgati, nakayona sanda hela. Nakahiluka haluga kuno yabubuwale kwa gala galawile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majendo ga kuluta Emau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Malichi 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Kuli zuwa lilila, walanguswa weli wa Yesu nawali mzila woluta kuli chijiji chilinguchemigwa Emau chiwele utali wa kilomita kumi na imwe kulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Nawali wolongasa kuwala gala geng'ha galawile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Lowawele wolongasa Yesu nakalawila, nakajenda hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Nawamona ila meho gawo nagalemezwa leka waleche kumzela. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Nakawauza, “Mwangulongasa choni kuno mjenda?” Nawo nawema ne kulonga chinhu kuno kumeho kwa hewo nakwali na masinzo. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yumwe wa hewo yalinguchemigwa Kiliopasi, nakamuuza, “Ndaze, hegwe ndo mjenzi hano Yelusalemu uwele hulinguvizela galawile kuli mazuwa gano?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Naye nakawauza, “Mbuli zachi?” Nawo nawamwidichila, “Mbuli zimfichile Yesu wa Nasaleti. Heye nayali mloli yawele na ludali lukulu kuli ulonzi wa heye na madito gake, hali Nguluwi na hali wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Watambika wakulu na vilongozi wa hetwe nawamlavya yatagusigwe kubagama, nawamuwamba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Ila hetwe natwali tuchitumbila kota heye ndo koigombola Isilaeli. Mzidi wa ago, lehano ndo zuwa lya kadatu kulawila mbuli azo vyozikoleche. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Hihyo du wamwe wa wadala kulawa kuli chilundo cha hetwe nawatukabusa. Nawaluta kuli chilaga lehano mitondo, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ila hawalufichile lukuli lwake. Nawahiluka nawalonga kota nawalawilwa na wahilisi wa kilanga, nawawalonjela kota Yesu kamkomu. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Hamba wamwe wa wayetu nawaluta kuli chilaga, nawafika kota hila wadala vyowalonjile, ila nawo hawamuwene.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yesu nakawalonjela, “Lekachoni mwawapoka ahi na nhumbula za hemwe hambe zikunde geng'ha galonjigwe na waloli? <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ndaze, haimganile Kilistu kugazigwa kwa nzila ayo hamba yenjile kuli welile wa heye?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Nakawatang'hulila mbuli zeng'ha zilingumuwala heye kuli Maandiko Matakatifu, kwaluchila chitabu cha Musa mbaka waloli weng'ha.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Lowawele habehi na chila chijiji chowawele woluta, Yesu nakawa kota yalingulutilila kumwando, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />ila hewo nawamdedeza wolonga, “Wikale hamwe na hetwe kwa vila sambi ndo matinazo na nechilo yahabehi.” Lelo, nakenjila mgati, nakekala hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Loyekalise kulya hamwe na hewo, nakalihola ibumunda, nakalitambichiza, nakalimogola, nakawapa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Baho du meho ga hewo nagagubuligwa, nawamzela, ila heye nakajilila, hawamuwene kahi. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Lelo nawalongasa, “Ndaze, nhumbula za hetwe haziwele zikwaka mgati mwa hetwe mhela loyawele yotutang'hulila Maandiko Matakatifu kula mzila?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Nawoka mhela wuwula, nawahiluka Yelusalemu, nawawafika wala watumigwa kumi na yumwe na wala wanji wawele hamwe na hewo, wekungajize <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />wolonga, “Ndikomya Mkulu nakazilipuka, nakamlawila Simoni.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Hamba wala walanguswa weli nawawalonjela gala galawile mnzila na ndaze vyowamzelele Yesu kwa kumogola ibumunda.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguwalawila walanguswa wa heye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matei 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Malichi 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Madito 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Vyowawele wowalonjela ago, Yesu nakema hali hewo, nakawalonjela, “Mikale goya.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Nawatinhuka na kudumba wochiijesa kota nawalyona ihoka. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ila Yesu nakawauza, “Lekachoni mwangudumba? Lekachoni namuwa na lunhwinhwi mnhumbula za hemwe? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mlole moko na magulu ga heni, ndo nene baha. Mndolize leka mtawize, kwa vila ihoka lyahela lukuli na mizeje kota vyomlingumbona.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Loyasindile kulonga ago nakawalajila moko na magulu gake. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Lowawele kuli kulemwela kukunda kwa chiwalo cha kusangalala na kububuwala kwa hewo, nakawauza, “Mwanacho chilyo choneche hano?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Nawamha chihande cha somba ibanichigwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Naye nakachihola na kulya hali hewo. <verse eid="LUK 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Hamba nakawalonjela, “Aga ndo gala gondiwalonjele londiwele hamwe na hemwe, kota geng'ha gandichigwe kuwala heni kuli malajizo ga Musa na kuli vitabu vya waloli na kuli chitabu cha Zabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Aho nakagubula nyhala za hewo leka wavizele Maandiko Matakatifu. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Nakawalonjela, “Ndo vyoyandichigwe kota Kilistu kogazigwa na kuli zuwa lya kadatu kozilipuka kulawa kuli isi ya wabagame, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />kulonga gehile na kulechelwa gehile vyowikuligwa kuli wanhu wa isi zeng'ha kwa kukolela itagwa lya heye kwaluchila Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Hemwe ndo mwawalolezi wa mbuli azi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Nene baha ndowagalila yula yawele Mhaza nakalagana na heni kota komlajiza, ila mbeteze aku mjini mbaka hompegwa wula mong'ho ulingulawa kilanga.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanguholigwa kuluta kilanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Malichi 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Madito 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Hamba nakawalongoza mbaka Betaniya, nakenula moko gake kuchanya, nakawatambichiza. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Loyawele yowatambichiza, nakawaleka, nakaholigwa kilanga. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Hamba nawamfugamila na kuhiluka Yelusalemu wawele na usangalalo ukulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Nawo nawekala mhela weng'ha kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi kuno womtogola Nguluwi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>